<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">- Gamo Geesha Maxxafa</book>
  <para style="h">Maatosa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Maatosa</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Dawite na, Abrame na gidida Yesus Kristosa yeletetha zarkey hayssappe kaalizayssa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Abiramey Yisaqa yelides. Yisaqay Yaqoobe yelides. Yaqobey Yudane iza ishata yelides. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yuday Timarippe Faresane Zara yelides. Faresy Asrome yelides. Asromey Arame yelides. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Aramey Aminadabe yelides. Aminadabey Ne7asone Yelides. Ne7asoney Selimone yelides. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Selimoney Bo7eze Ere7abippe yelides. Bo7ezey Urutippe Iyobede yelides. Iyobedey Iseye yelides. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Iseyey kawo Dawite yelides. Dawitey Oriyo machcheyfe Solomone yelides. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Solomoney Robi7ame yelides. Robi7amey Aabbiya yelides. Aabbiyaykka Aasafe yelides. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Asafey Yosafaxxe yelides. Yosafaxxey Iyorame yelides. Iyoramey Oziyane yelides. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Oziyaney Iyoatamme yelides, Iyoatamey Akaze yelides, Akazey Hizqassa yelides. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Hizqassay Minasse yelides, Minassey Ammoxe yelides, Amoxxeykka Yosiyasa yelides. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yosiyasay Babiloone di7o layth Ikoniyanene iza ishata yelides.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Babiloone di7oppe guye Ikkoniyaney Salatiyale yelides, Salatiyaleykka Zarubabele yelides, <verse number="13" style="v"/>Zerubabeley Abiyodde yelides, Abiyodey Eliyaqqemme yelides, Eliyaqqemmey Azare yelides. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Azarey Sadeqqe yelides, Sadoqqey Akimme yelides, Akimeykka Eliyodde yelides, <verse number="15" style="v"/>Eliyodey Alazare Yelidess, Alazarey Matane yelides, Mataney Yaqqobbe yelides. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yaqoobeykka Kirstosa getetidaysa Yesusa yelida Maramo ekana gigisida Yosefo yelides.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Hesa gish Abirameppe yidi Dawite gakanas tamane oydu yeleteth, qasse Dawiteppe Babiloone di7o wode gakanas taammane oydu yeleteth, Babiloone di7oppe Kirstossa yeleteth gakanas tamane oydu yeleteth gidana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesus Kirstosa yeletetha tarikey hessa mala; iza ayeya Marama Yosefos gigista utada dishin izi izira gagonta dishin Xillo Ayanan qanthatada bistadus. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Izo gigisida Yosefoy xillo asa gidida gish Maramo asa sinthan qonce kesonta qotara aganas ba wozinara qachidess. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Haysa izi qopishin Xossa kitanchay agumora izas qoncidi “Dawite na Yossefo ne gigisida Marama qanthatiday Xillo Ayanan gidida gish izo ne so efanas baboppa, <verse number="21" style="v"/>Iza adde na yelana, izi asa nagarappe ashanade gidida gish iza sunth ne Yesusa ga sunthana” gidess.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22-23" style="v"/>Godday nabe Isayasa dunan “hekko gela7oya qanthatana, atumanakka yelana, naza sunthaykka Amanu7ele getistana, hessa birshechikka &lt;Xossi nunara&gt; gusa getetidi xafetidaysi polistana mala haysi wurikka hanidess.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yossefoykka dhiskkoppe begidi Goodda kitanchay iza azazida mala Maramo ba so efidess. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Gido atin bada iza koyro naza yelana gakanas izo ekibeyna. Yeletida gutha naza suntha Yesusa gidess.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Away mokiza bagappe yida erata /eranchata/</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kawo Herodosa wode Yesusay Bistaleme Yihudan yelettidappe guye away mokiza bagappe erata/eranchati Yerusalame yidi <verse number="2" style="v"/>“Yeletida Ayhude kawoy awan dize? away mokiza bagara iza xolinteza beyidi izas goynana yidos” gidi oychida. <verse number="3" style="v"/>kawo Herodosay hessa siyidi dagamidess, Yerusalamen diza asay wuri izara dagamidess. <verse number="4" style="v"/>izika qesista halaqatane woga tamarsizayta kumeth shishidi “Kirstosay awan yeletane” gidi oychidess. <verse number="5-6" style="v"/>istikka izas “nabey ‘Yuda bitan dizare hane Bistaleme ta dere Isra7eele nagizadey neppe kezana gish hanko Yuda harizaytappe azanikka guxakka’ gidi xafida gish izi Bistaleme Yudan yeletana” gidi yotida. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hesafe guye Herodosay he erata/ eranchata/era asata geemara xeygisidine ista hasa7isidi xolintezi istas betida likke wode eridess. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Erata Bistaleme yedidi “bidi gutha naza koyte takka bada izas goynana mala demida mala ha taakko simidi izi awan dizakkon tas yotite” gidess. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Eratikka/eranchatikka kawoy istas gidaysa siydappe guye bida. Away mokida bagara istas betida xolintey ista kalethidi gutha nazi dizaso gathidess. <verse number="10" style="v"/>isti xolinteza be7ida wode daro ufa7etida. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Keth gelidi gutha naza iza ayeyra Maramira demidine gulbatidi izas goynida. Be saxine saxine doyidi worqqa, ixanene, karbe giza miish izas imida. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Isti Herodosakko simononta mala agumon kehi nagistana mala getetida gish hara ogera ba dere simida.</para>
  <para style="p">Gibxe gango <verse number="13" style="v"/>Era asati/erati/eranchati/ bidappe guye Goda kitanchay Yosefos agumora betidi “Herodosay gutha naza wodhana koyiza gish ne simana wode ta nena erisana gakanas dendada gutha naza ayeyra ekada duge Gibxe biitta baqatada hen dasha” gidess. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Hesa gish Yosefoy dendidi ayiyo nazara ekidi gidothara duge Gibxe bidess. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Herodosay hayqana gakanas hen de7idess. “Ta naza ta Gibxe bitappe xeygadis” gidi Goday kasse nabe dunan hasa7idays hayssan poletidess. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Eranchati/erati/ era asati iza balethidaysa erida wode Herodosay kehi hanqetidess. Eranchati izas kasse yotida wode mala ba assi kitidi namm7u laythane namm7u laythappe garsata Bistalemenine Bistaleme yushon diza gutha atuma nayta wursi wodhisidess. <verse number="17-18" style="v"/>Hesan “Yeehoyne gita waaso girthay Raman siyetidess, Era7ela ba naytas yekadus, nayti wuri wurida gish minanas danda7onta ixadus” getetidi nabe Ermasan yotetidaysi poletidess.</para>
  <para style="p">Gibxeppe Nazrete simo <verse number="19" style="v"/>Herodosay hayqidappe guye Goda kitanchay agumora Yosofos Gibxe biittan betidi <verse number="20" style="v"/>“Dendada gutha nazane iza ayiyo ekada Isra7eele biitta sima, naza wodhana koyizayti hayqida” gidess. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yosefoy dendidi naza ayeyra ekidi Isirae7el biitta simidess. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Gido atin Arkela7osay ba awa Herodosa ola Yuhudan kawotidaysa siydine he banas babidesss. Goday agumora izi he bonta mala yotida gish Galila awuraja bidess. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nazrete getetiza kaatammayo bidi hen dus oykidess. Kasse nabetan “Nazrawe getistana” getetidi kassetidi sinthafes hasa7etidaysi kumidess.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Xaammaqiza Yaanisa Sabakko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v"/>He wode xaammqiza Yaanisay asas “salo kawotethi matida gish inte nagarappe simite” gi sabakishe Yihuda bazo biittara yidess. <verse number="3" style="v"/>“Goda ogge othite, wogga oggezakka lo7othite gishe bazo biittan wasiza qaala” getetidi kasse nabe Isayasan yotetidaysi Yaanisa gishasa. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yanisay gamela ithikkeppe othetida mayo mayess, ba xesikka dafora gixess, izi miza qummay degera essanne bole. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yerusalameppe, kumetha Yiudappene Yordanosse shahaaththaa matan diza dere wursoppe asay wuri Yaanisakko woodhdhidi <verse number="6" style="v"/>ba nagarakka izas paxxishe Yordanosse shaafan iza kushen xaamaqetidess. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Daro farsawetinne saduqaweti izi xamaqizaso yishin beydi Yaanisay “inteno shoshato iintte sinthara diza hanqoppe atana mala intena oni beside?” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Iintte iintte nagrappe simidaysa besiza otho othitte. <verse number="9" style="v"/>‘Nu away Abiramey nus dess’ gizaysan interkka intena balethopitte, ta intess Xoossi hayta shuchatappe Abirames na othi denthanas danda7es gays. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Hekko beeyxxey qanxxanas miththata garsan gigeti utidess. Hesa gish Lo7o ayfe ayfonta mithi wuri qanxxistanane taman yegistana. <verse number="11" style="v"/>tani marotethas hathan xamaqays haray ato shin ta iza caama tokanas besontadey, tappe adhiza minoy guyera yana, izikka Xillo Ayananine tamn intena xxamaqqana. <verse number="12" style="v"/>kath suragiza layday iza kushen dess, izikka ba kaththa baleza piti geeshana, ba gistezakka kaththa di7en qolana, happa gidikko to7onta taman xxugana.” gidess.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusay xxamaqqetidess</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>He wode Yesusay Yanisan xamaqistanas Galilappe Yordanose shaafa bidess. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Gido atin Yanisay “haysi hanena tani nenan xamaqistana besishin neni waanada taakko yayi?” gidi izara eqetidess. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesuusaykka “aykkoyka ba ero garki! hayssa othidi nuni xilloteth wursi polans nus beses” gidess. Yansaykka iza qofa ero gi ekidess. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesusay xamqetidi hathappe kezida mala herakka saloy doyetin Xossa ayany woolle kafo milatidi iza bolla wodhishin beyidess. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Saloppekka “tani izan ufa7etiza nazine ta siqiza ta nazi hayssakko” giza qalay siyetidess.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesusay pacetidess</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hessappe guye Xillo Ayanay Xala7en pacistana mala Yesusa duge bazo bita efidess. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Oydu tammu galasine oydu tammu qama xoomidappe guye Yesuusay gafidess. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Pacizaysi Yesusakko shiqidi “ne Xoossa na gidikko ane hayta shuchata uketh gidana mala azaza” gidess. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesusaykka “ ‘assi Xoossa dunappe keziza qalanppe atin kaththan xala deenna’ getti xafetidess” gidi izas zaridess. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kalethidikka Xala7ey yesusa gesha katamayo efidi meqidese ketha quste bola kesidi <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Ne Xoossa na gidikko ane hayssappe duge guppa, ays gikko ‘ne toy suchan dhuphetonta mala kitanchati ba kushra nena denthana mala ne gish Xoossi ba kitancha kiitana’ geteti xafetidess” gidess. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesusaykka “qasse maxafatan ‘ne Xoossa Godda paaccoppa’ geteti xafetidess” gidi zaridess. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Qasekka Xala7ey Yesusa kehi dhoqqa zuma bola kesidi salo gufanthon diza kawotetha iza bonchora wursi ehi besidi <verse number="9" style="v"/>“ne kundada tas goynikko hayssa ubbaa ta neess iimana” gides. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesuusay hayso “Xala7e ta sintahppe hakka neni ne Godas Xossas goyna, izas Xalala goyna getetidi xafetidess” gidess. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hesappe Xala7ey iza agidi bidess, kiitanchatikka yiidi iza madida.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusay sabakko oykidess/domides/</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesusay Yansay qachetidaysa siyidi gede Galila simmidess. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nazirete katama agidi Zabilone Niftaleme heran aba matan diza Qifirnahome kataman duus oykidess. <verse number="14-16" style="v"/>Hesan Zabilonenine Niftaleme bitan, Yordanoseppe he pinthan aabba gaxxara ehaaththaiza ogge matan diza ayhuda gidonta Galila dere asay, dhuuman diza derey wolqama po7o be7idess, Hyqo kuwa garsan diza deress po7oy po7idess' getetidi nabe Isayasa dunan kasetidi hasa7etidaysi poletidess. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesuusay he wodeppe domidi “Salo kawotethi matidess marota gelitte” gidi sabakko oykidess.</para>
  <para style="s">koyro iza kalizayta xeygeteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesuusay Galila aabba achara adhishe nam7u ishantata, heytikka Phixxirosa getetiza Simonane iza isha Indirasa be7idess. Istika mole oykizayta gidida gish mole oykiza gite aban yegishe detess. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesusay ista “ha yite tana kalite, ta intena asa oykiza as othana” gidess. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Isti herakka mole oykiza giteza yegidi yesusa kalida. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Guth sinthe bishe hara nam7u ishantata Zabdosa na nam7ata Yaqobene Yanisa be7idess. Istika ba awa Zabdosara wogolo gidon mole gite lo7othetes, Yesusaykka ista xeygin <verse number="22" style="v"/>isti herakka wogolozane ba awa agidi kalida.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusay hargizayta pathidess</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesusay ista mukuraben asa tamarsishene kawotetha mishiracho qaala sabakishe qasse dere garsan ay hargey sakizaytakka pathishe kumetha Galila yuydess. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Hesa gedon lo7o nashoy kumetha Soore biittan siyetidess. Dereykka dumma dumma sakon daro wayzaytane daydanthi istan gelidaytane, bolappe biittan yegiza hargey dizayta, silidayta izakko ehin wursikka pathidees. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Hesafe dendidaysan Galilappe, tamu katamappe, Yerusalameppene, Yihudappe, Yordanose shaafa pinthappe yida daro asay iza kalidess.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesusay zuma bola tamarsida timrte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Daro derey shiiqidaysa beyida wode Yesusay pude zuma bolla kezidi utides, iza kaalizaytika izakko yida. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Izikka ista hizigidi tamarso oykides. <verse number="3" style="v"/>ayanan bena kawushizayti anjetidayta</para>
  <para style="q2">ays gikko salo kawothi istasa.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>qadhetizayti anjetidayta</para>
  <para style="q2">ays gikko isti ministana.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>ashketi anjetidayta</para>
  <para style="q2">ays gikko isti biitta latana.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>xiloteth gafetizaytine saamotizayti anjetidayta</para>
  <para style="q2">ays gikko isti kalana.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>asas lo7o othizayti anjetidayta</para>
  <para style="q2">ays gikko istikka lo7oy othistana. ????</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>wozana xilloti anjtidayta</para>
  <para style="q2">ays gikko isti Xoos beyana.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>saroteth oothizayti anjetidayta</para>
  <para style="q2">ays gikko isti xoosa nayta geeteti xeygistana.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>xillotetha gish goodetizayti anjetidayta</para>
  <para style="q2">ays gikko salo kawotethi istasa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ta gedon asay intena cayikko, goodikonne iita yo wordora inte bolla haasa7ikko inte anjetidayta. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Inte salon demana waagay keehi gita gidida gish ufaysan guppitte. Ays gikko intefe kase nabetakka hessaththo gooddida.</para>
  <para style="s">maxinene poo7o leemiso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>inte ha biita asas maxine mala. Maxiney ba mal7otetha yediza gidiko zaridi demanas danda7ize? gede kare yegetidi yedheteespe atin. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Inte deres po7o. Zuma bola diza katamaya qotistanas danda7uku. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Asi xoomppe oythidi kethan diza asa wursos po7ana mala dhoqason wothetes atin gema son wothi eretena. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hesathokka asay inte lo7o otho beydi inte salon diza inte aawa bonchana mala inte po7oy asa sinthan po7o.</para>
  <para style="s">Muse woga gish</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Tani Musse wogane nabeta qaala sharana yida intes milatopo; polanas yadis atin sharanas yabeykke. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ta intess tumu gays, saloyne bitay adhana gakanas Musse wogay wuri polistana atin wogappe isi pidaleykka woykko issi qerinakka shaaretuku. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Hessa gish onikka ha azazoyntafe guxizaro gidikokka othonta yegi adhikko, hankoytakka yedhi adhana mala tamarsikko salo kawotethan he uray guth geteti xeygistana. Gido atin hayta azazota othi polishe hankoyta polana mala tamarsikko izi salo kawotethan gta getistana. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ta intes gays, inte xillotethi Parsawistapene Musse woga tamarsizayta xillotethafe aadhonta agikko salo kawoteth gelana danda7ekista.</para>
  <para style="s">Shempo wodhanas besena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kasse asatas wodhopa, wodhida ura bolla pirdistana getetidaysa inte siydista. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ta qasse intes gizay ba isha bolla wogay baynda hanqetiza ura bolla pirdistana, onikka ba isha napay gizadey dere dulata sinthan oychistana, eya giza ura ganame tama pirday naages. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Hessa gish neni yarsho shishizason Xoossas yarshana gishin ne ishay ne bolla michetidazi nes qofetikko, <verse number="24" style="v"/>ne yarshizaysa hen yarshoson aga gada koyro bada ne ishara giga, hessafe guye simada ne yarshoza Xoossas shisha. <verse number="25" style="v"/>nena kasasida ne morkey ne bolla pirdsonta mala pirdiza danay qachizaysas nena athi imonta mala qasho kethan ne wodhontamala buro ogge bolla dashe ne morkke urara elela giga gida. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ta nes tumu gays izi pirdisi wursida gidikko wusetha isi santimiyo qanxana gakans qashoppe birshistakka.</para>
  <para style="s">Laymatanas besena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>laymatoppa gizaysa inte siydista <verse number="28" style="v"/>Tani gidikko intena hiz gays macasha amo ayferra xelida uray wuri ba wozinan izira laymatadess. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Nagara othans ne oshacha ayfey nes gaso gidiko neppe kessa wora yega, ne asatethay kumeth gede ganame taman yegistanape ne asatethafe isay pacikko lo7o. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ne oshacha kushey nagara othos gaso gidiko neppe qanxa diga ne asatethay kumeth ganamen yegistanaysafe ne asatethafe issi bilitey ness pace gidiko lo7o. <verse number="31" style="v"/>machcho anjizadey anjida firma waraqata izis imana beses getetidees. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Tani qasse intena hizgays hara urara laymatishin beyonta dishe ba maco anjizadey wuri iza laymatana mala othes. Hesathokka anjetizaro ekizadeykka laymatida mala qodetes.</para>
  <para style="s">Caqo gish</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>kasse asatas wordo caqofa; Xoossa sinthan ne caqidaysa naga getetidaysa inte siyidista. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Ta qass intena aykkokka caqofite gays saloy Xoossa wonbara gidida gish salon caqofite. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Bitay Xoossa soy shempizaso gidida gish bitankka caqopite woga kawo katama gidida gish Yerusalamenkka caqopite. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Inte hu7enikka caqopite inte hu7e iskistappe issineyokka bothu woykko kareth histanas danda7ekista. <verse number="37" style="v"/>hessa gish inte inte garsan hasa7etishin inte hasa7ay E ganaz E gite akkay ganas akkay gite, hessappe kare gididay wuri ita urappe yizaza.</para>
  <para style="s">Halo Kesso Gish</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Ayfe gishas ayfe acha gishas acha getetidaysa inte siyidista <verse number="39" style="v"/>Ta kass intes gizay ita othida urara eqetofite gido attin nes oshacha shagala baqizades hankoysakka yusha bessa. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Issi uray ne garsara maydaysa neppe ekkanas nena motikko bolara maydaysakka gujada izas imma <verse number="41" style="v"/>Issi ass nena issi sate ooge ne bana mala wolqathikko issippe nam7u dakko gidana ogge iza bays. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Nena wosizades imma, neppe tal7e ekkanas koyzades zokko zaroppa. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Ne lagge siqa, ne morke siqa getetidaysa siyidista <verse number="44" style="v"/>Ta qass intena inte morketa dosite, intena godizaytas wosite gays. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Inte hessaththo othikko inte salo awas nayta gidana. Izi awa arshe itatasine lo7otas issi bola omo imess irakka xilotasine nagaranchatas issi bola bukises. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Intena dosizayta xalala inte dosikko intes aza wagay dize? Qaraxa ekizayti hessaththo othetene? <verse number="47" style="v"/>Inte ishata xala inte sarothikko hankoytappe azan lo7eti? amnontaytikka hessaththo othetes. <verse number="48" style="v"/>hessa gish inte salo away wothoy bayndade gidida mala intekka wothoy bayndade gidite.</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Manqos mado immo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Assi intena beyana mala asa sinthan lo7o othonta mala nagetite, hessaotho othiko inte salo awappe waga demekista. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Inte manqotas mado immiza wode assi tana beyo gidi asa sinthan bonchetanas ogenine mukuraben xurumba punisiza qodheppe qomon hanizaytatho othofite. Ta intes tumu gays isti ba waga wursi han ekki gidida. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Inte manqotas imishin oshacha kushey othiza hadirsa kushey eroppo. <verse number="4" style="v"/>inte immoy geman gido qotan othetidaysa beyiza inte awaykka inte waga intes immana.</para>
  <para style="s">Wossa gish</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Inte wosishe qodheppe qomon hanizayta mala hanopite isti assi beyana mala mukurabistanine oydu ogge bola eqidi wosanas dosetes. Ta intes tumu gays isti kumetha waga ekichida <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ne wosana wosiza ne kifile gela kare ne bolla gordada geman diza ne awakko wossa. Geman othetidaysa beyza ne away ne waga nes immana. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Amanonta asay issi qaala zari zari wosiko istas siyetiza milatin isti zari zari gizaysatho intekka wosishe issi qaala zari zari gopitte. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Gido atin inte away inte wosanappe kasetidi intes azi koshizakone eriza gish inte ista milatopitte. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Inte wosishe hizgi woossite “salon diza nu Aawo ne sunththi anjjetto, <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ne kawotethi ha yo; Ne sheney salon gidida mala bitankka hano. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hachchis gidiza kath nuus hach imma. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nu nuna qohidaytas atto giza mala nekka nu qoho nuus atto ga. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Iittappe nuna asha attin nuna paacen gelthofa; Bonchoy medhippe medhina gakkanaas neyssakko; amin77i” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Inte intena qohidaytas ato gikko inte salo away intes ato gana. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Qasse inte asa nagara ato gonta ixikko inte awaykka inte nagra ato gana.</para>
  <para style="s">Xoomma gish</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Inte xoomma xoomishe qodheppe qommora xoommizaytatho shulupitte. Isti ba xoommizaysa assi erana mala ba ayfeso isetes. Ta tumu gays hessaththo othizayti ba wagga kummeth ekki gidida. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Neni xoomma xoomikko ne ayfeso mecista, ne hu7e tiyista. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Hessatho ne xoommikko geman diza ne away xalala erizazine assi onikka eronta qotan gidana. Qotan othetidaysa beyza ne awaykka ne wagga ness immana.</para>
  <para style="s">Salon diza haro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Bil7ay mizason buqidine shiydi moretizason kaysoy bokidi kaysanas danda7izason ha bitta bola intes mishe shishopette. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Gido atin bilay manas, buqidi woykko shiyidi moretonta kaysoy bokki ekkana danda7ontason hen salon intes mishe shishite. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ne mishay dizason ne wozanay hen dess. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ayfey asatethas po7o hessa gish ne ayfey paxa gidikko ne kumetha asatetethay po7o gidana. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Ne ayfey hargancha gidikko ne kumetha asatethay dhumma xala gidana, histikko nenan diza po7oy dhumma gidikko qasse dhummay wanida gird gida dhumma gidande? <verse number="24" style="v"/>Issi uray nam7u godas othana danda7ena. Issa ixidi nam7anthoza dossana, woykko issa bonchidi nam7antha leqana Xoossasine mishas nam7atas gathi othanas danda7etena.</para>
  <para style="s">Daro qopopitte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Hessa gish ta intena inte dussa gish ay mino? ay uyino? ay mayino? gidi hirgopitte gays. Shempoy qumappe ashoy mayoppe adhene? <verse number="26" style="v"/>Anne salo kafota xelite zeretena maxetena di7en qoletena shin inte salo away ista muzes. Inte istafe kehi adheketi? <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ane intefe daro wayetidi bes immetida laytha bola hara issi galas gujana danda7iza asi dize? <verse number="28" style="v"/>Qsse mayo gish aazas hirgeti? anne co denban diza cishata xelite, daburetena woykko suqetena. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Hessa gish ta intena gizay haray ato shin kawo Solomonaykka ba bonchora ha cishatappe isiney mala lo7o maybeyna. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Inteno pace amanoy dizayto hachi asa ayfen betidi wonto taman wodhana mata hayssatho mayziza xoossay intena hessafe lo7othi athi mizanas danda7ene? <verse number="31" style="v"/>Hessa gish nu ay mane, ay uyane, ay mayne gidi hirgopitte. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Hankko ammanonta asay hayssa demans daro qopes. Haysi wuri intes koshizaysa inte salo away eres. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Hara wursoppe sinthatidi Xoossa kawotetha xilloteth koyte hayti wuri intes gujistana. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Hesa gish wontos keezi qopopitte, wonto metoy wontos aqo. Issi issi galasay bess gidiza metora dess.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Hara asa bola pirdanas koshena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Inte bola pirdetonta mala hara asa bolla pirdofitte. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Inte pirdida mala inte bola pirdistana. Inte makkida mishara intes makistana. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ne ayfen diza gita miththa beyonta dashe ne isha ayfen diza qeri bura aazas xelay? <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ne ayfen gita mith dishin ne isha “ane ta ne ayfeppe qeri buuryo kesays” ganas wana danda7ay? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Neno qodheppe qommon hanizayso kasistada ne ayfen diza gita miththa kesa gida hessafe kalada ne isha ayfen diza bura kesanas lo7otha xelandasa. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Be ton yedhonta malane simidi intena saxi dakerethonta mala anjetidaysa kanata sinthanine Worqa gudunthata sinthan yegopitte.</para>
  <para style="s">Wosite, koyte, qoxite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>wosite intes imistana, koyte inte demana kare qoxitte intes doyistana. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Wosidades wursos imistana koyza uray demana qoxizades karey doyistana. <verse number="9" style="v"/>inte gidoppe isadenay uketh wosikko shuchu immiza aaway dandde? <verse number="10" style="v"/>woykko mole wosikko shoshu imizadey dande? <verse number="11" style="v"/>Histin inte itata gidi utidi inte naytas lo7o miish immo erizayta gidikko inte salo away iza wosizaytas waanidi adhiza lo7o miish imane? <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hessa gish hara assi intes othana mala inte koyzaysa mala intekka haratas othite. Musse wogayne nabeti hayssan kuuyetes.</para>
  <para style="s">Aho pengene xuntha penge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Xuntha pengera gelitte, dhaysana efiza oggey gita, pengeykka aho, daro asay he pengezara geles. <verse number="14" style="v"/>deyos gathiza ogey gidiko xuntha, pengeykka xuntha, gelanaytikka guuthata xalala.</para>
  <para style="s">wordo nabeta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>istas garssa bagay *sudhume /kana suyqqe/ mala* giidi utidine dorssa ite mayidi inte gido gelid garssara oothiza wordo nabetappe naagetite. <verse number="16" style="v"/>inte ista ista oothon erandista. Aguntha worappe woyney, qum7ude agunthafe etha ayfey maxetizee? <verse number="17" style="v"/>Hessathokka lo7o mithi wuri lo7o ayfes iita mithika iita ayfe ayfees. <verse number="18" style="v"/>lo7o mithi iita ayfe ayfanas danda7ontaysa mala iita mithi lo7o ayfe ayfanas danda7ena. <verse number="19" style="v"/>lo7o ayfe ayfonta mithi wurikka qannxxistanane taman yegistana. <verse number="20" style="v"/>hesssa gish inte ista ista ayfen erana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>salon diza ta aawa shene polonta dishe tana ‘godo godo’ gizay wuri salo kawotethi gelena. <verse number="22" style="v"/>he gelas daroti “godo godo nuni ne sunthan buro hananaysa yootibeykoni? ne sunthan daydanthi kesibeykoni? ne sunthan daro malata oothibeykoni?” gaana shin <verse number="23" style="v"/>he wode ta istas “ta intena mulekka erabeykke inte iitati taape haakite” gaada qoncera ta istas yootana.</para>
  <para style="s">keethi keexiza eeyone erane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>histikko hayssa ta qaala siyidi oothon peyshizadey ba keeth zaala bolla keexizade milatees. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Handzidze iray bukin haroykka gogides carkoyka carkides, keethaka sugides, shin zaala bolla keexetida gish kundibena. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Haysa ta qaala siyidi oothonta uray gidiko ba keeth ace bolla keexxida eeya ura mala. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Handzidze iray bukin haroyka harotides, carkoyka carkides, he keethaka sugides keethayka iita kundethi kundides. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesuusay tamarsi wursin asay iza timirtezan malaletides. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Gasoyka Musse wogga tamarsizayta mala gidonta izi godatethi diza asa mala tamarsida gishasa.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusay inchiracha hargey oykida adeza pathides</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesuusay zuma bolafe wodhin daro derey iza kaalides. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Isi inchiracha hargey dizadey yesuusakko shiiqidi iza sinthan gulbatidi “Godo ne koykotana pathanas dandayasa” gides. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesuusay ba kushe yedidi “ta dosadis paxa” gin adezi he hargezappe heerakka paxides. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Qasseka Yesuusay adeza “ne paxidaysa oonasika yootopa, gido attin baada nena qeeses beessa. Musey azazida yarshoza gaatha, hesika istas markka gidana” gides.</para>
  <para style="s">Xeetu wotadarata halaqa amano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesuusay qifirnahome gakidda mala xeetu wotadaratas halaqay izako shiiqidi iza hizgi woosides. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Godo ta ashkaras asatethay oothonta ixin daro saketidi keeththan zin7on dees gides. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesuusaykka izas ta baada pathana gides. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Xeetu wotadarata halaqay izas zaaridi “ta neena ta keeth gelithanas besizade gidike, gido attin ne haan daada issi qaala xala giiko ta ashikaray paxana. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Taasikka tana azaziza halaqati taape bollara deetes, qassekka taas azazetiza wotadarati taape garssara deetes istafe isa ba giiko bees qase isa haaya giikko yees ta ashikara ‘hessa ootha’ giiko oothees” gidess. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesuusay iza zaarozan malaletidi bena kaalizayts “ta intes tumu gaysi haray atoshin Isira7eelista garsan hayssa mala amanoy dizade isadeka demabeykke. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ta intes yootays daroti away mokiza bagafene wuliza bagafe yana salo kawotetha madan Abramentara Yisaqantaranne YaaqobEntara issipe utana. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Salo kawotethi istas gidana besiza asati heen kare duman yegistan heenka yehoyne acha garceth gidana” gidess. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesuusaykka xeetu wotadarata halaqas “ne ba ne amano mala nees hano” gides; ashikarazi heraka paxides.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusay darota pathidess</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesusay buro Pixirosa keth gelishin Pixirosa bolotiya micha harge sakistada zin7idaro be7idess. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Izi kushe Yesusay bochin michay agin dendada Yesusa mokadus <verse number="16" style="v"/>He galasa omars daydanthi oykida daro asata Yesusako ehida. Izikka tuna ayanata ba qalara istafe kesidess, harganchatakka wursi pathidess. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Isayasay “izi nu harge ekidess nu sakokka tokidess” gida qalay hayssan poletidess.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Daro asay iza yuyi adhidaysa beydi Yesusay asa abafe he finth pinana mala azazidess. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Hesa wode issi ayhude amano tamarsizadey izakko shiqidi “tamarsizayso ne biza wursoso takka nena kalana” gidess. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesusaykka izas zaridi “workenats oolay dess, salo kafotas kafo kethi dess, tas asa nas gidikko hu7e gelithizasoykka bawa” gidess. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Iza kaliza issi hara uray qasse “Goddo koyro bada ta aawa moogo?” gidess. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Izi qasse “hayqidayti ba hayqeth moogeto; neni gidikko tana kaalla” gidess.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusay aba danbala co7u histidess</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Hesafe guye Yesusay wogolon gelin iza kalizaytikka wogolon kali gelin issippe bida. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Qopponta aba gidon danbalay dendidi wogoloyo mitana gakkanaas ista waysidess. Hessi wuri hanishin yesusay dhiskidess. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Iza kalizayti iza begothidi “Godo nu dhayos nuna asha” gida <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesusaykka ista “inteno amanoy pacidayto aazas hayssa mala babeti?” gidess. Hessappe dendidi carkozane abba danbala izi hanqin herakka sirph gidess. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Istika “Haysi abayne carkoykka izas azazetizadey izi wanidade” gidi malaletida.</para>
  <para style="s">Tuna ayanappe paxida nam7u asata gish</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Izi aba pinidi Gergesenone giza dere gakida mala daydanthi oykida nam7u asi dayti ba diza dufope kezidi iza gagida. Assi he ogezara adhanas danda7etonta mala asas daro kehi meto gidi detes. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Istika “Xoossano ness nunara aza gogotethi dize? Nu wodey gakkonta dishin nuna xugana yadi” gidi wasida. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Hen istafe guth hakidi daro guduntha wudey issi bola hemetes. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Daydanthati Yesusa “ne nuna kessana gidikko haytan daro gudunthatan nu gelana mala nus fiqadde imma” gidi wosida. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesusakka ista “bitte” gides. Daydanthatikka istafe kezidi gudunthatan gelida. Gudunthati wurikka ba dizaso afora bezumishe aban gelidi hathan mitetidi hayqida. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Guduntha hemizayti elelidi katamay dizaso bidi gudunthay hanoysane daydanthi ista oykida asata bola hanidaysa wursi asas yotida. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Katama asay wuri Yesusara gaganas kezidess. Yesusay beydine ista dere yedi banamala iza wosida.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Gunda adeza paxo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hesafe guye Yesusay aba bola wogolora pinidi kasse ba diza katama yidess <verse number="2" style="v"/>Hen issi gunda ura asay zaphara tokidi Yesusakko ehidess. Yesusaykka ista amano beydi gunda ura “aykoy ba hayso nazo ne nagaray ato getetidess” gidess. <verse number="3" style="v"/>He wode woga tamarsizayti “haysi Xoossa casha giidi ba ulora gugimida.” <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesusay ista qohaaththaa eridi “inte wozinan iita yo aazas qopeti? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ne nagaray ato getetidess gusapene dendada ba gusafe awaysi kawushe? <verse number="6" style="v"/>Gido atin asa nas biita bola asa nagarappe maranas sheney dizaysa eranamalasa giidi gunda adeza” denda ne zapha ekada gede neso ba” gidess. <verse number="7" style="v"/>gunda adezikka dendidi beso bidess. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Dereykka hessa beydi malaletethanine babon kumidi hayssa sire godatethi asas immida Xoossa galatidess.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusay Maatosa xeygidess</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesusay heppe dendidi bishe issi Maatosa gizadey qaraxa qanxisizason utidaysa beydi tana kala gin dendidi iza kalidess. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesusay Maatosa son maada bola dishin daro qaraxxa shishizaytine nagranchati izakko yidi izarane iza kalizaytara issippe manas utida. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Parsaweti hessa beyidi Yesusa kalizayta “intena tamarsizaysi qaraxxa shishizaytarane nagranchatara wosti istara issippe kath mize? gi oychida. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesusaykka isti gizaysa siyidi ista” aakkimey koshizay saketidaytas atin saketonta paxatas gidena. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Hessa gish inte biidi “yarsho gidonta maroteth dosays giza qaala birshech tamaritte. Nagaranchata xeygana yadis atin xilota xeyganas yabeyke” gidess.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusa kalizayti xooma xoomonta gaso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Xamaqiza Yanisa kalizayti Yesusakko yidi “nunine parsaweti xoomishin nena kalizayti aazas xoometene” gi oychida. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesusay istas “mishira lageti mishiraz istara dishin mozistana danda7izo? mishiray istafe ekistana wodey yana, isti he wode xoomana gidess. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Gal7a mayo bola oratha qanxeth wothi sikiza asi dena. Gal7a bola orath wothi sikiko orathazi galaza pedherethidi ha das darsana. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Oonikka oratha woyne caje gal7a ogoron gujenna. Gujiza gidikko ogorozi dhuqana, woyne cajezikka gukkana, ogorozikka go7ay bayndaz gidana. Gido atin oratha woyne cajey oratha ogoron gujetes, hessa malara woyne cajezine ogorozi lo7o nagetidi gam7ana. FFFFFF needs foot note.</para>
  <para style="s">Ya7irosa nayone Yesusa afala macara bochida macashayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesusay asa hasa7ison dishin issi shuumey iza sinthan kundidi “tas na dara hayqana gaysu iza paxa dana mala yada ne kushe izi bola wotharki” gin <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesusay dendidi izara bidess, iza kalizaytikka izara bida. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Tamane nam7u layth kumeth izippe suthi gukiza issi macashi Yesusape guyera yada iza afala macara bochadus. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Iza hessa othiday haray atiko iza afala xera bochizakko ta faxana giza amanoy izi wozanan diza gish bochadus. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesusaykka guye simi xelidi macashayo “aykkoy ba ta naye nena ne aamanoy pathidess” giin maccashaya herakka paxxa agadus. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesusay shuumeza kethako gakishin derey zayeranne dinkera wasishe yeekizaysa be7idi <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kichite naya dhiskadus atin hayqqabeyku giin isti iza bolla miicida. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Derey wuri keethafe kezin izi keeth gelidi nay kushe oykides; nayaka denda eqadus. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Wooreykka dizason dizason laaletides.</para>
  <para style="s">Sesuusay duna mumezane qooqeta pathides</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesusay heepe bishin nam77u qooqeti “Dawite no nuna maarariki” giidi waasishe iza geedo kaalida. <verse number="28" style="v"/>qooqetika yesuusay gelida keeththa iza kaalidi gelida. yesuusaykka ista “ta inte ayfe pathana dandda7izaysa amaneeti?” giidi oychides. istikka ee godo gida. <verse number="29" style="v"/>hessafe guye yesuusay ista ayfe bochidi “inte amano mala intes hano” gidees. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Isita ayfeykka xeelides yesuousaykkaoonikka hayssa eronta mala” giidi minthi yootides. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Gido atin isti kezidi heera wurisoson yesuusa gish woresida. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Isiti heepe kezishin daydanthi oykida isi duuna muume ura yesuusako ehida. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Daydanthazi kezidape guye he duuna muume adezi hasa7a oykidess; derezikka malaletidi “hayssa mala hanoy Isra7eele biitan haniin nu beyi erokko” giida. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Gido atin parsawista zaaridi iza “daydanthi kesizay daydanthata halaqana” gida.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusay asas michetides</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesuusay ista mukuraben tamarisishene xoosa kawotetha mishiracho yootishe qasekka harge wursoppe asa pathishe katamanine mandaratan yuuyides. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Asay wuri heemizadey baynda dorssa mala keehi metotetidi xeelizay bayndade gididaysa be7ida wode istas daro michetides. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Bena kaalizaytikka “maxa gakida kaththay daro shin maxi shiishizayti guuthata. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Hesa gish kaththa goday kaththakko oothanchata yedana mala woosite gides.”</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa kaaliza tamane nam7ata kiiteteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesuusay bena kaaliza tamane nam77u <verse number="2" style="v"/>Tamane namm7u hawarista sunthay hayssafe kalizaysa; koyro Pixerosa getetiza Simona, Iza isha Indirasa Zabdosa na Yaqobene iza isha Yanisa <verse number="3" style="v"/>Filiphosane Bertelemosa, Tomassane qaraxa shishiza Maatosa, Ilfosa na Yaqobene Tadosa, <verse number="4" style="v"/>Be bagas zili7etiza Simonane guyeppe Yesusa hayqos athi immida Asqoroto Yuda <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hayta tamane namm7ata wurssi gede amanonta dereta gath bopitte Samariya asa katamma gelopite <verse number="6" style="v"/>atin Isra7ele keth gidida dhayda dorsatakko bite. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Bidine salo kawoteth matidess gidi sabakite. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Harganchata pathitte, hayqidayta hayqoppe denthite, inchiracha hargizayta geshite, daydanthata kesite inte mela ekidaysa mela immite <verse number="9" style="v"/>Worqa, bira woykko xarqimala gidin inte kissen oykofite. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Othnchas hachis hachis gidizazi koshiza gish inte oges giidi shinqqe, koshonta mayo, caamma woykko gufe eki bopitte. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Issi katama woykko issi mandara inte geliza wode intena mokkanade koyi demidi iza kethan shempitte heppe kezana gakanas hen takitte. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Inte onna kethekka gelishe saro gite. <verse number="13" style="v"/>He kethay sarotay besiza keth gidiko inte sarotay he kethas gido, sorotay besonta keth gidikko inte sarotay agidi intes simmo. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ay assikka intena mokki ekkanasine inte giza siyanas koyontade gidikko he ura kethappe woykko he katamaappe kezishe issta bolla yiza gomeppe inte atidaysas markka gidana mala inte to bolla diza guddula pitidi kezitte. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ta intess tummu gays pirda galas he katmay bolla gakkana pirday Soodomma bolane Gamora bolla gakkida pirdappe deexo gidana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ta intena dorssa mala sudhumista gidora kitays. Hessa gish shosha mala cincatane wole mala ashikkista gidite. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Assay intena oykkidi pirdiza dulatas shishana, ba mukuraben intena garafana, hessa gish istafe nagetite. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ta gedon dere harizaytakkone kawotakko intena efana. Ista sinthenine amanonta asata sinthan inte markka gidana. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Intena isti oykkiza wode nu ay gi hasa7ino, woz gi mal/th/s/e immino gi hirgoppitte. He wode inte gaanazi intes immistana. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Intenan hasa7anay inte aawa ayanappe atin intena gidekista. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ishay ba isha hayqos aathi imana, aaway ba na bolla, nayti bena yelidayita bolla dendidi hamakal7anane hara asa wodhisana. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ta gish asi wurikka intena ixxana. Gido atin wurseth gakkanaas mini eqiday izi atana. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Asay intena inte diza heerape gooddikko haraso kichite. Ta intes tumu gaysi inte isra7eele katama wursi gakkonta dishin ta asa nayi yaana. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ashkaray godappe woykko kaalizadey kalethizadefe aadhena. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Tamarey bena tamarisizayssa mala woykko ashikaray goda mala gidikko hesi izas gidana. Keetha aawa be7el zebula giikko so asa ays hessafe iita geetene?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Hesa gish istas babopite; geemetiday qonconta qotetiday geeshi kezonta atena. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ta intes dhumara yootidaysa poo7on haasa7ite haythan siyidayssa qonchen haasa7ite. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Asho wodhikofe atinshempppo wodhanas danda7ontaytas babopite hessafe ashone shemppone gaaname taman dhaysanas danda7izaysas babite. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Issi santen bayzetiza nam77u gashe kafotappe isiniyakka inte salo aawa sheney baynda co kunda atiku. <verse number="30" style="v"/>haray ato shin inte hu7e iskeykka taybon dees. <verse number="31" style="v"/>hessa gisha babopite daro gashe kafotape inte waagay aadhi bonchetidaza. <verse number="32" style="v"/>asa sinthan taas markatizades taaka salon diza ta aawa sinthan izades mrkatana. <verse number="33" style="v"/>qase asa sinthan tana kadhidhade taka salon diza ta aawa sinthan iza kadhana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Ta biita bolla saroteth ehanas yida intes milatopo; maasha ehanas atin saroteth ehanas yabeyke. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Tani yiday na aawappe, maca na aayipe, machcho bolotippe shaakanasa. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Asas morkey so asa gidana. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Taape aathidi ba aawa woykko ba aayo siiqizadey taas gidanas besena. Taape aathidi ba atuma na woykko, meeca na siiqiza uray taas gidanas besena. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Mesqele tookidi tana kaalonta uray taas gidanas bessenna. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Be shemppo aashshanas koyza uray dhayses; ba shemppo ta gish aathi imizadey aashes.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Intena moki ekizadey tanakka moki ekes. Tana mokki ekizadey tana kitidadekka moki ekess. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Issi nabe nabetethan moki ekizadey he nabeza waga demana. Xillo ura iza xillotetha gish mokki ekkiko he xilloza waga ekkana. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Hessa gish ta intess tummu gays onikka hayta guthatappe tana kalizade gidida gish issi xu7a irxa hath ushikko hiniskka wagay dhayena.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Xamaqiza Yanisay kitida asata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesusay bena kaliza tamane nam7u asatas azazo immi wursidappe guye tamarsanasne sabakanas Galilan diza katamta bidess. <verse number="2-3" style="v"/>Yanisay qasho kethan dishe kirstosay othiza hanota siyidi bena kalizayta izakko yedidi ass ashizadey yana getetiday nene ye hara nagino gidi oychidess. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesusaykka zaridi “biidi inte sidaysane inte beyidaysa Yanisas yotite. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Qoqeti xeletess wobeti hamutetes inchracha hargizayti geyetes tuuleti siyetes hayqidayti hayqoppe paxi dendetes manqotas mishracho qalay yotetes.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Tanan dhuphetontadey anjetidade. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yanisa kalizayti bidappe guye Yesusay asas Yanisa gish hizgidess “azi beyanas duge bazo bideti carkoy qathiza shombaqo beyanas yideti? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Woykko az beyanas kezideti? Lo7o mayo mayidi lo7i utidade beyana yideti? Lo7o mayo mayidi lo7izayti kawota kethan deteess. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Histin az beyana kezideti? nabe beyana kezideti? Ee ta intes gays nabeppe adhizaysa beyanasa. <verse number="10" style="v"/>“Ne bana ogee neess gigisanade neppe sinthara kalethada ta ness kitana getetidi iza gish kasse xafetida uray izakko” gidees. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ta intess tumu gays maccashappe yelettida asappe xamaqiza Yanisa milatiza uray biita bolla dendibeyna. Gidikkokka Xoossa kawotethan asa wursoppe lafa uray Yanisappe aadhana. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Xamaqiza Yaanisa wodeppe ha simmin ha7i gakanas salo kawotethi daro bagara sugetees. Izzo demanayti mino asata xala. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nabetikka Musse wogaykka wuri Yaanisa wode gakkanaas buroppe hananaysa yotida. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Histikko inte ekkana koykko izi yana getetida Elasay izakko. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Siyiza haythi diza uray siyo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16-17" style="v"/>Haysa ha wode asa azan lemusso? Giyan uttidi ba lagista “Nu intess dith dixin inte duribeykkista yeho zilalith zilalin yekibeykista giza nayta milatetes. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yaanisay musafene ushafe naagetidi yida gish daydanthara dess gida. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ta asa nay mashene uyashe yiin haysi midi kalonta asa, ushanchane qaraxa shishizaytasine nagaranchatas lage gida. Gido attin Xoossa eratethi ba othon xiladus.</para>
  <para style="s">Amanonta ixida gish walasetida katamtta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20-21" style="v"/>Hessappe guye Yesusay izi malatata othida katama asay marotethan gelonta agida gish “Kurazinene Betesayda intena aye inte bolla othetida malatay Xirosa bolane Sidona bolla othetidakko isti maqa maydinne bidinthan utidi beni beni marotethan geli gidanashin. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Hessa gish tani intes gizay firda galas inteppe adhidi Xiirosasine Sidonas qixaatey kawuyana. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Hanne Qifirnahome pudde salo dhoqu dhoqu ganas koyadi? Gido atin neni duge si7ole wodhandasa, ne bolla othetida malatay Sodomen othetidakko Soodomey hach gakanas daanakoshin. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Hessa gish ta nena gizay pirda galas qixatey neppe Soddomas kawuyana. /s Kirstosay immiza shemppo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Hessa wode Yesusay hizgidi wosidess. “Salo bitta Godo, ta awo, hayssa daro eranchatappene cinccatappe qotada qeri naytas ne qoncisida gish ta nena galatays. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Aabo Ee haysi ne sinthan lo7o ne shene gididi betidess. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Wurikka ta aawappe tass imetidess, aawappe atin naza gish eriza uray bawa, qasse nazappene nazi ba shenen qoncisida urappe haray aawa eriza uray ba. <verse number="28" style="v"/>inteno, tokkoy dexidaytine daburidayti wurikka taakko ha yitte, takka intess shemppo immana. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ta qambara tokitte tappekka tamaritte tani ta wozinan aadane ashke inte shemppos inte shemppo demana. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ta qambaray shaykone ta tohoy kawushe.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Sambata gish Shiqida oycha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hesappe guye Yesusay sambata galas kaththa gidora adhi bidess. Iza kalizaytikka gafida gish tiya duthidi shigechi muus oykidda. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Parisaweti hessa beyidi Yesusa “hekko nena kalizayti sambata galas oothistanas besontaysa oothetess gidda.” <verse number="3" style="v"/>Izikka istas zaridi “Dawiteyinne izara diza asati gafida wode izi ay othidakkone nababibeyketi? <verse number="4" style="v"/>Xoossa keth gelidi qesistappe attin Dawiteyne izara dizayti bochanas besonta dumma uketh midess. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Woykko qeseti sambata sharidi meqidess gidon otho othikko moro gidontaysa ooritte wogappe nababibeyketi? <verse number="6" style="v"/>Gidikkokka ta intess gizay meqdeseppe adhizadey han dess. <verse number="7" style="v"/>“Yarsho gidonta ta maroteth dosays” giza qaalay ay gusukunne inte erizakko xillota bolla pirdekistakkoshin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>asa nay sanbatas godda” gidees. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Heppe izi gede adhishe ista mukurabe gelidess. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Henikka issi kushe silidadey dess. Yesuusa kasasanas gasso koyidi “sambata galas pathanas besize?” gidi iza oychidess. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Izikka ista “inteppe isadde dorsi sambata galas olan gilikko ba dorssa izi gelidi ollafe gochi kessi erene? <verse number="12" style="v"/>Histikko assi dorssappe kehi adhene? hessa gish sambata galas lo7o oothoy digetena” gidess. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Addeza “ne kushe pidisa” gidess, addezikka ba kushe pidisin hinkko kusheza mala paxa gididees. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Giddo atin parsaweti heppe kezidine Yesuusa wosti oyki wodhanakone ba garsan zoretidda.</para>
  <para style="s">Xoossi dorida ashikkara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesusay ista qohaaththaa eridi heppe haraso deesh gidess. Daro derey iza kalidess harganchatakka wursi pathidess. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Izi onakone asas yotonta mala ista azazidess. <verse number="17-21" style="v"/>Hesikka haniday nabe Isayasan</para>
  <para style="q1">“Ta doridayne ta izan ufa7etiza ta nay haysich;</para>
  <para style="q2">ta ayanappe ta iza bolla wothana,</para>
  <para style="q2">izikka amanonta deretas tumu pirda awajana,</para>
  <para style="q2">oyetena, woykko wassena.</para>
  <para style="q1">Izas qalaykka karen siyetena,</para>
  <para style="q2">Tuma pirda xonos gathana gakanas tinceti utida</para>
  <para style="q2">shomboqokka menthenane</para>
  <para style="q2">cuwatiza muqadakka toysena,</para>
  <para style="q2">amanonta dereti iza ufaysan nagana” getetidi yotetida tinbite qalay polistana.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusanne bi7el zebula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Hessappe guye daydanthi oykin xelanasine hasa7anas dayda7onta issi ura Yesusakko ekki yida. Yesusaykka iza pathin addezi xelanassine hasa7anas dandaydess. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Assay wurikka malaletidi “haysi addezi Dawite nasha?” gidess. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Giddo atin parsaweti hessa siyda wode “Haysi addezi daydanth kesizay daydantha halaqa bi7el zebula wolqan xala gidanas besses” gida. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesusay ista qofa eridi “ba garsan isay issappe shaketiza kawotethi wurikka kundana, ba garsan shaketiza katamay woykko ketha assi minena. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Xala7ey Xala7e kesiza gidkko Xala7ey ba garasan shaketidess gusa. Hessatho hanikko iza kawotethi wani minana danda7ize? <verse number="27" style="v"/>Tani bi7el zebula wolqan kesiza gidikko inte nayti aza woliqan kesane? Hessa gish inte nayti inte bolla pirdana. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Gido atin tani daydanth kesizay Xoossa ayanan gidikko Xoossa kawotethi intekko yidess gussa. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Woykko issi uray wolqara dizade keth gelidi mishe bonqana koyikko kasetidi he wolqara dizadeza oyki qashonta wosti bonqane? Qachidappe guye bonqana dandayes. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Tanara gidontadey tanara eqetes, tanara issippe shishonta uray wurikka lales. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Hessa gish ta intess tumu gays nagara othoyne cashi wuri asas ato getistana shin Xillo ayana cayida uray maretena. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Ay assikka asa na bolla hasa7iza iitta qaalay maristana shin Xillo Ayana bolla hasa7iza iita qaalay gidikko hayssa ha woden gidin woykko buro yana woden gidin maroy deena.</para>
  <para style="s">Lo7o mith ba lo7o ayfen eretes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Mithi wuri ayfen eretizaysa mala inte lo7o ayfe demana mala intes lo7o mithi deyo, intes iita mithi diza gidikko inte ita ayfe ekkana. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Inteno marzera diza shoshato inteni iitata gidi utidi wosti lo7o hasa7anas dandayeti? Ulo garsan kumidazi dunara hasa7etess. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Lo7o assi ba wozinan kunthi wothida lo7o yooppe lo7o hasa7es, iitta assikka ba wozinan kunthi wothidda itatethappe iitta yo kesses. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Gido atin ta intess gizay asay ba hasa7ida hada qaala wurso gish pirda galas wurikka oychistana. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Gassoykka ne qalappe dendidaysan ne xilada atanane ne qalappe dendidaysan ne bolla pirdistana</para>
  <para style="s">Malata beyanas shishida oycha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Hessappe guye issi issi Musse woga tamarsizaytine parsaweti Yesusa “astamare, nu neppe malalsiza malata beyanas koyos” gida. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Izi istass zaridi “ha iitane layma yeletay malata oyches gido attin nabbe Yoonasa malatappe atin hara malatay imetena” gidess. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yoonasay gita mole ulo giidon heedzdzu qamane hezu galas gami7ida mala asa nay hezu galasine hezu qamma bitta ulon gam7ana. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Nanawe asay pirda galas hayssa ha yeletara dendidi ha yeleta bolla pirdana; gasoykka Nanawe asay Yoonaasa markatethan maroteth gelida gishasa. Hekko Yoonaasappe adhizadey han dees. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Dugge baga dere kawoya Solomoone erateth siyanas bitta gaxappe dendada yidda gish pirda galas iza hayssa yeletethara dendada ha yeletetha bolla pirdana. Hekko Solomooneppe adhizadey hayssan dess.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Tuna ayanay asappe kezidi sheemppo demanas hathi baynda mela bitan dabures, gido attin ba koyiza shemppo demena. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Hessappe qasse kasse ta dizaso siimma bana gidi beniso izi simishin kasse izi dizasoy aykoyne baynda mela keth gididi geyidine gigeti dizaysa deemess. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Hessafe bidi hara beppe itiza lapun iitta ayanata benara ekidi yeess. Istika he uran gelidi deyana. He uras kasse dusafe guye dusay iita gidana. Haysa iitta yeletethaskka hessa mala hanana.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusa ayiyone iza ishata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Yesusay asas yotishin iza ayiyane ishati iza yochana koyidi karen eeqidashe; <verse number="47" style="v"/>Issi uray hekko ne ayane ne ishati nena hasa7isanas karen eeqidi nena koyetes gidess. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Yesusaykka ta aya oone? ta ishatich isti oonante? gidess. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Be kushera bena kalizaytakko malatidi, ta ayane ta ishati haytanta. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Salon diza ta aawa shene othizayti wurikka tass isha michchonne ayo gidess.</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Zereth zerizde Lemiso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>He galaskka Yesusay kethafe kare kezidi abba achan utidess. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Daro derey iza yuyi adhidi gidothida gish asa aba gaxan agidi wogolo gido geli utidi, <verse number="3" style="v"/>Daro yo lemusora hizgi yotidess “issi goshanchay zereth zeranas kezidess <verse number="4" style="v"/>Izi zerishin issi issi zerethi ooge achan wodhiin kafoti yidi maxi mida. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Issi issi zerethi melane shuchatiza bitta bolla wodhin bittay mela bitta gidida gish elele caarides. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Gido atin away awin shulidine xapho yedonta agida gish melidess. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Issi issi zerethay aguntha gidon wodhidess, agunthaykka dicidi carecha culidess. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Hara zerethikka loo7o orde bittan wodhidi ayfekka ayfidess, issay xetu, issay usupun tamu issay hezu tamu ayfe immidess. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Siyiza haythi diza uray siyo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Hessafe iza kalizayti izakko shiqidi aazas lemusora yotay gida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Izikka istas hizgidees “Salo kawotetha xuuray intes imitidess istas gidikko immetibeyna. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Dizades dizaysa bolla gujistanane darana shin bayndadafe hina dizarakka ekista gidana. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ta hayssatho lemusora yotizay isti siyshe ezigonta gishine xeelishe deemonta gishasa. <verse number="14-15" style="v"/>Isayasay</para>
  <para style="q1">“Inte sisa siyanashin yushi qopekista,</para>
  <para style="q2">xeelo xeelana shin wozinan wothekista,</para>
  <para style="q2">dereza wozinay mumides, ista haythaykka</para>
  <para style="q2">siyena, xelonta mala ba ayfe qili7imida,</para>
  <para style="q2">hesi bayndakko issti ba ayfera beydine</para>
  <para style="q2">ba haythara siyidi ba wozinan yushi qopidi</para>
  <para style="q2">taakko ha simin ta issta pathana shin” gida tinbite qalay istan poletidess. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Inte ayfey xeliza gishine inte haythati siyiza gish inte anjetidayta. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ta intes tumu gays daro nabetine daro xillo asati ha7i inte beyzaysa beyanasine ha7i inte siyzaysa siyanas amotida shin istas hanibeyna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Histikko ha7i zeretha lemusoza birshech siyite <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kawotetha qaala siyidi yushi qoponta ay asa wozinappekka Xla7ey yiidi zaretida zeretha bogi ekki gidana. Hessikka ogge bolla wodhida zeretha. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Shucha bolla zaretidaysi qaala siyda mala ufaysan siyidi herakka ufaysan ekizade milates. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Gido atin xapho yedanas danda7onta agida gish daro gam7onta qaalla gedon metoyne godetethi yiza wode eleli dhuphetes. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Aguntha gidon zaretida zerethay qaala siyidi hayssa ha alamezas daro metotethane duretetha qofan baletidine culetidi ayfe immonta asa mala. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Lo7o bitan zaretida zerethay qasse qaala siyidi yushi qopizade milates tuma ayfe ayfes, isay xetu issay usupun tamu issay hezu tamu ayfe imidess.</para>
  <para style="s">Lesho lemuso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesusay hara lemiso istas hizgi yotidess; salo kawotethi ba gosha bittan lo7o zereth zeridade milates. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Gido atin assi wuri zin7ida wode iza morkey yidi gisteza gidon lesho zeridi bidess. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Gisitezi dicidi ayfe ayfiza wode leshoykka izara issippe betidess. <verse number="27" style="v"/>kaththa goda ashikarati godakko shiqidi “godo, ne goshan lo7o zereth zerabeykki? Haysi leshoy awappe yide. gida. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Izikka istas hessa morkey othidess gidess. Ashikatatikka nu bidi leshoza harumana mala koyiza gi oychida. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Izikka istas, akay hanena gasoykka inte leshoza harumishe gistezara gathi shodana, <verse number="30" style="v"/>aagite maxa wodey gakanas issippe dico. He wode maxizayti leshoza kasetidi qori maxidi taman xuganas miirqen miirqen qachite, gisteza qasse shishidi gotaran/ pedhen/ gelthite gada ta intes yotan gidess.</para>
  <para style="s">Mitha ayfene irsho lemuso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Hara lemuso istas hizgides “salo kawotethi issi uray ba gade gidon zerida etha ayfe mala. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Etha ayfey hara miththa ayfe wursoppe daro lafa gidikkokka dicada miththa wursoppe gitta gidaysu. Salo kafotikka izi hange bolla keexidi deyana gakanas gita mith gidaysu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Ha7ikka hara lemuso istas hiz gi yotides salo kawotethi macashi liixxey dendanamala liixxe gidon gujida gutha irsho milataysu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesusay hayssa wursi asas lemusora yotidess. Lemusoy baynda issinokka yotibeyna. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Hessankka kasse nabe donan “ta duna ta lemuson doyana; alamey medhetosoppe ha simin qotetidaysa ta hasa7ana” geteti yotetidaysi poletidess.</para>
  <para style="s">Lesho lemusoza birshech</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Hessappe asa agidi keth gelidess. Iza kalizayti izakko shiqidi kaththa gidon diza leshoza gish ne yotida lemusoza birshech nus yota dida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Izikka istas zaridi lo7o zereth zeriday asa na <verse number="38" style="v"/>Gosahy hayssa alameza, lo7o zerethay kawotetha nayta gididaysa besess, leshoy qasse Xal7e nayta. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Leshoza zeridi bida morkey dabilosa. Maxxa wodey alame wursethi gidishin maxxizayti Xoossa kiitanchata. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Leshoy qoretidi taman xugetizaysa mala alame wursethan hessaththo hanana. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Asa nay ba kitanchata kittana istikka nagaras gaso gididaytane iita ochizayta iza kawotetha garsappe wursi qori kessana. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Yeehoy dizasone ache garcizaso daro wolqamma taman ista yegana. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Hessa wode xilloti ba aawa kawotethan awa arshe mala po7ana. Siyiza haythi diza uray siyo.</para>
  <para style="s">Qotan diza harone inqo giza worqqa lemuso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Salo kawotethi gade gidon qotetida mishe milates. Issi uray he mishiyo demidi zari qotidess. Ufaysafe dendidaysan bidi bess dizaz wursi bayzidi he mishiya diza biitta shamidees. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Hessathokka salo kawotethi al7o worqa koyza zal7ancha milatess. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Daro al7o gidida inqo giza shucha demida mala bidi bess dizaz wursi bayzidi shamidess.</para>
  <para style="s">Mole gite lemuso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Qassekka salo kawotethi abba gidon yegetidi dumma dumma mole oykidda mole gitte milates. <verse number="48" style="v"/>mole oykizayti gittey kumiza wode gochidi abba mata kessida. Hen utidi lo7o lo7o mole qoridi keechen gujida. Iitta molista wora yegida. <verse number="49-50" style="v"/>Alame wursethan hessaththo hanana. kitanchati yidi nagaranchata xilotappe shakidi yekizasone ache garcizaso gede to7onta taman yegana. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Yesuay ista haysi wuri intess gelide? gidess. Istika E gida. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Izikka zaridi “hessa gish salo kawotetha xuuray gelida Musse woga tamarsizadey oonikka izas miniji wothida al7o mishappe oorathane kasse ceega miish kessizade milates” gidess.</para>
  <para style="s">Be deren bonchetonta nabe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Yesusay hayssa lemusota yoti wursidi heppe haraso bidess. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Gede ba dere biidi ista mukuraben asa tamarso oykidess. Istika malaletidi haysi adezi hayssa eratethane hayta maalatata oothana wolqa awappe demide? <verse number="55" style="v"/>Haysi anaxeza na dene? iza ayeyi sunthi Maramo dene? Iza ishati Yaqobene Yosefone Simonane Yihuda gidetene? <verse number="56" style="v"/>Micheti nunara dizayta gidetene? Histin haysi adezi hayssa wursi awappe ekide? gida. <verse number="57" style="v"/>Hesa gish isti izi gizaysa ekkibeytena. Yesusay istas “nabey ba derenine ba kethan bonchetena atin harason bonchetes” gidess. <verse number="58" style="v"/>Isti amanonta agida gish daro malatata hen othibeyna.</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Xamaqiza Yanisa hayqo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>He wode Galila dere hariza Herdosay asay Yesusa nashizaysa siydess. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Herdosay ba ashikaratas “Hessa gidikko xamaqiza Yanisay hayqoppe dendidi yidess gusakka! Haysi wuri gitta malatay iza kushen othetizay hessasa” gidess. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Herdosay ba isha Piliposa machcho Herodiyada gason Yanisa oythidi qasho keth (woynene) yegidess. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Gaasoykka Yanisay Herodossa ne izo ekkana mala wogga gidena gida gishasa. Footnote- Pilip is stil alive <verse number="5" style="v"/>Heredosaykka yanisa wodhanas koyshin asay Yanisa nabe mala xeliza gish babidess. <verse number="6-7" style="v"/>Herodosay ba yeletetha galas Herodiyada naya yethan iza ufaysida gish naya iza oychidaz wursi imanas izis caqidess. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nayakka ayeyi zoren xamaqiza Yanisa hu7ey keren wothada ah7i hanini tas imma gadus. <verse number="9" style="v"/>He wode kawoy michetidess. Gido atin caaqida gishine izara diza imathata gish giidi nay oychoy polistanamala azazidess. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kiitidine Yanisay woyne kethan dishin qoodhdhe qanxisidess. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Qanxetida hu7eza keren wothidi nays imida. Nayakka ekkada ba ayeys immadus. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yanisa kalizayti iza aha ekidi moogidine hanidaysa wursi Yesusas yotida.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusay ichach shi asa muzidess</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Hessa siyida mala Yesusay kasse ba dizaso agidine wogolon gelidi berkka hara poqethaso bidess. Dereykka hessa siydi katamay dizasoppe tohora iza kaalidess. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesusay wogolozappe wodhishe daro asa beydi asas michetidess. Saketizaytakka pathidess. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Galasaykka qammi qammi bizaysa beyidi iza kalizayti izako shiqidi haysi nu dizasoy bazokko, gadeykka qami qami biza gish gede mandara bidi bes manaz shamana mala asa yeda gida. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Gido atin Yesusay ista “inte asas manaz imite atin asay banas koshena gidess. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Istika istas zaridi “hayssan nus ichachu ukethine nam7u molistappe atin haray bawa” gida. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Izikka ista ane he dizayta ha tass ekki yite gidess. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Qassekka asay maata bola utana mala azazides ichachu ukethane nam7u molista ba kushen oykidi ba ayfe pude salo doqu histidi galatidi uketha menthidi bena kalizaytas imidess. Istika asaas imidda. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Asay wurikka midi kalidess. Hessappe guye iza kalizayti asappe mishin atidaysa tamane nam7u masobe kumeth shishida. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mida asay macashane gutha nayti gujetonta atumasi xalala ichachu shi gidana.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusay abba bola hamutidess</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Herakka iza kalizayti wogolon gelidi gede he pinth izappe kasetidi pinana mala azazidi asa moyzanas bess guye atidess. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Dereza moyzidape guye wosa wossanas berkka zumma bolla kezidess. Gadey dhuminkka hen zumma bolla berkka dess. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Hessa wode wogoloya abba kantha bishin bulahey dendidi daro metotho oyqidess. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Qaamappe koyro kutoy zamare baqishin (uushin) Yesusay abba bollara hamutidi iza kalizayti dizaso yidess. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesusa kalizaytikka izi abba bollara hamuti yishin beydi babidi iza moytil7e gidine babidi wasida. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesusaykka herakka aykkoy ba tanakko babofite gidess. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Pexirosay Godo, nena gidikko ta abba bollara hamutada neekko bana mala tana azaza gidess. <verse number="29" style="v"/>izikka iza haya gidess. Pexirosaykka wogolozappe wodhidi hatha bolara hamutidi Yesusakko yidess. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Gido atin carkoza wolqa beyidi babida gish hathan miteteth oyqidi “Godo tana asha gidi waasidess.” <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesusay herakka ba kushe yedi oykidi “neno amanoy pacidayso aazas sidhadi?” gidess. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Pexirosayne Yesusay wogolozan gelida mala carkoy sirphi gidess. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Hessappe guye wogolon dizayti “Neni tumu Xoossa na” giidi izas goynida.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusay Genserexe harganchata pathidess</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Aaba pinidi Genserexe gizaso gakida. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Hen dizayti Yesusa gididaysa erida wode he heran yuyi adhanas diza asas kiita yedida. Asaykka harganchata wursikka Yesusakko ehidess. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Harganchati iza afala xera xala bochana mala Yesusa wosida. Bochidayti wurikka paxida.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Qassekka Yerusalemeppe yida farsawetine Musse wogga tamarsizayti Yesusako shiqidi <verse number="2" style="v"/>nena kalizayti kasse nu awata wogga aazas dhaysizo? Qumma manas kushe ecetetena gida. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesusaykka istas “Inte inte wogas gidi Xoossa azazo ays shareti? <verse number="4" style="v"/>Xoossi ne ayiyone ne awa boncha; ba awa bolla woykko ba aye bolla iita qaala hasa7idadey hayqo gi azazishin <verse number="5" style="v"/>inte gidikko ay asikka ba awa woykko ba ayo ta intes othanas besizaz ay mishekka Xoossas yasho atha shishadasa gikko <verse number="6" style="v"/>issi uray hessa othikko ba awa woykko ba ayo bonchontadess gista hessa gish inte wogas gidi Xoossa qaala sharista. <verse number="7-9" style="v"/>Inteno qodheppe qomon hanizayto Isayasay inte gish yotishe “Haysi derey tana dunan xala bonches wozinay gidikko tappe hakidees meda hada tana goyness; ista timirteykka assi wothida wogga gidi sinthappe hananaysa yotidaysi tumakko. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesusay asa bekko xeygidi siyite wozinan wothite <verse number="11" style="v"/>asa tunisizay awa dunara pude kezizazippe atin dunara duge gelizay tunisena” gidees. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Qasse iza kalizayti izakko shiqidi “farisaweti ne gidaysa siyidi hanqettidaysa eradi? gida. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Izi istas ta awa saloysi tokonta mithi wurikka dhoqistana <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ista agagite isti qoqeti kalethiza qoqista gidida gish qoqeti qoqe kalethikko nam7ay isay isara oyketidi afon wulana <verse number="15" style="v"/>Pexirosay Yesusa ne yotida lemusoza nuss birsha gidess. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Izikka “Inte ha7i gakanasikka eri beykista gusse? gidess. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Dunara gelizay wuri duge qanthe kanthidi gede kare kezizaysa ereketi? <verse number="18" style="v"/>Dunara kezizay gidkko wozinappe pultees; asa tunisizay hessa. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Itta qofay shemppo wodoy; laymay; laymatanas qaqatoy; kaysoy wordo markatethine asa sunthi moroy wuri wozinappe pultess. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Assa tunisizay haytantappe atin kushe mecetonta musi ass tunisena.</para>
  <para style="s">Kanaane dere macashay ammano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesusay heppe kezidi gede Xirosane Sidona giza dere bidees. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Issi Kanaane macashi dizara he herappe kezada Yesusakko yada “Godo Dawite no tas michista ta naya tuna ayanay oykkin keha wayaysu gada wasadus. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Gido atin izi isi qalakka izis zaribeyna. Histin hessa wode iza kalizayti izakko shiqidi “nuna kala kala waysiza gish ne izo moyzikoch? gidi iza oychida. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Izikka istas tani Isra7ele kethappe dhayda dorsatakko xala kitistadis gidess. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Macashayakka Yesusa to bolla kundada “Godo tana madariki!” gadus. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Izikka izis zaridi nayta kath ekidi kana butalatas kanas yeganas besena gidees. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Izakka E Godo butalatikka ba goda madafe gaden wodhida kath maxi metes gadus. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Hizgin Yesusay macasheyo Hane macashaye ne amanoy gita, ne koyda mala ness hano gidees; macashayi naykka herakka paxidees. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesusay heppe dendidi Galila Aba ach bidi hen diza issi zumma bolla kezi utidees. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Qodan daro derey wobista qoqistanne, silata, hasa7onta mumista haratakka daro harganchata ehidi iza to achan wothida; izikka ista pathidees. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Mumey hasa7ishin to silay lo7ishin wobey sit gidi hamutishin qoqey xelishin beyidi asay malaletidees; Isra7ele Godakka galatidees.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusay oydu shi asa muzidees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesusay bena kalizayta xeygidi asay tanara hezu galas gam7ida gishine mana kathi baynda gish asay tana michees. Oge bollan gafan daburidi kundonta mala mela ulora yedanas koyke” gidees. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Iza kalizaytikka hayssan aykoykka baynda bazo bitan hayssa sire dere muzanas gidiza qumma nu awappe demane? gida. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesusaykka ista intes appun ukethi dize? gi oychin istikka lapun ukethine qi gutha moleti deetes gidees. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Izikka derey bitta bolla utana mala azazidees. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Lappun ukethine moleza ba kushen oykidi; galatidaysappe guye menthidi bena kalizaytas imidees; istikka deras gishida. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Asay wurikka midi kalidees, Yesusa kalizayti asappe atidaysa lappun masobe kumeth shishida. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Midaytikka naytine macashay baynda adeti xala oydu shi gidida. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesusay dereza moyzidappe guye wogolon gelidi Megidole getetizaso gidees.</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Parsawetinne Saduqawe getetizayti Yesusakko shiqidi iza pacanas saloppe malata bessa gidi oychida. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Izikka istas hizgidees “omarsa wode saloy zo7ikko gadey awana gista <verse number="3" style="v"/>wonta bolla saloy dexidi dexidees hach iray bukkana gista. Salo mala xelidi shakista shin ta yana wode malata shakanas danda7ekista. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Haysi itane laymma yeletay malata koyes gido attin yonasa malatappe hara mlatatay izas immetena. Yesusay ista hen agagidi hraso bidees. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Abba pinida mala yesusa kalizayti qumma oykanaysa baletida. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesusaykka qoppitte Paraawista irshopene Saduqawista irshoppe nagetite gidees. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Isti qasse ba gidon nun kath oykkonta gish hessa gidees gidi isay isara hasa7etida. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesusaykka ista qofa eridi inteno amanoy pacidayto “kath oykkonta gish aazas isay isara hasa7eteti? gidees. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ichachu ukethi ichachu shi asas gidid apun masobey tiripin inte dendiakkone yushi qopekketi? <verse number="10" style="v"/>Hesathokka lappun budenay oydu shi asas gididi appun masobey tirpin inte denthidakone wozinan wothibeykista guussa <verse number="11" style="v"/>Histin ta intes yotiday kaththa gish gidontaysa wanidi yushi qopeketi? Ha7ikka parsawista irshoppenne saduqawista irshoppe nagetitte. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ha7i izi ista qofisizay bukko denathanas gujiza irsho gish gidonta Parsawistane Saduqawista timirteppe nagistana mala gididaysi istas gelidees. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesusay Piliphos Qisariya getetiza bitta gakida wode bena kalizayta asay tana asa na oona gizze giddi oychidees.</para>
  <para style="s">Phexirosay Yesusay oonakone hasa7idees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Istika issi issi asay xamaqiza Yanisa ges baga asay Elasa gess bagay Ermassa woykko nabetappe issadde gidonta agena gess gidees. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Izikka ista intechi tanna onna getii gidees. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Simmona getetiza Phixirosay “neni Kirstosa deyo Xoossa na gidikki” giddi zaridees. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesusay “Yona na Simona neni anjetidade ness hayssa qincisiday salon diza ta awappe atin ashoynne suthi gidena gidees. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Neni Phixirosa (zala), hayssa zala bolla tani ta wossa keth kexxana ganame pengetikka izo xonetena. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Salo kawotetha qulfista ta ness immana, neni bitta bolla hanno gizay wuri salonkka hannana. Bitta bolla ne hanoppo gidaysi wurikka salonkka hanena. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kalethidikka izi Kirstosa (Xoossappe tiyetidade) gididaysa isti onasikka yotonta mala mala bena kalizaytas lo7othi yotidees. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Hessappe ha simin Yesusay Yerusalame banasne hen dere cimatanine qesista halaqatan Musse woga tamarsizayta kushen waye ekanasne hayqanas hezantho galas hayqoppe dendanas bena kalizaytas qoncisidi yotidees.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusay ba bolla gakkana meto gish nam7anthokka yotidees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Phixirosaykka gede issi baga gochi zaridi godo haysi ne bolla gakofo gidi hanqidees. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesusaykka Phixirosakko shiqidi “Hayso xala7ey hayssappe kicha neni asazappe atin Xoossa yoyi ne wozinan garsan baynda gish ne tas dhuphe gidadasa gidees. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Qassekka Yesusay bena kalizaytas “tana kalanas dosiza uray bena kado ba masqale (ba meto) tokidi tana kalo” gidees. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Be shempo ashana koyzadey wuri dhaysana, gido attin ba shempo ta gish dhaysizadey ashana. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Assi alamme kumeth harikoka shempos pacikko iza ayi madane? woykko assi ba shempo gish qanxana danda7izazi aze? <verse number="27" style="v"/>Assa nay ba awa bonchoranne salo kitanchantara yana issi issi uras iza otho mala iza waga immana. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Ta intess tumu gays hayssan eqida asata garsafe asa nay ba kawotethara yshin beyana gakanas hayqoy ista bochonta asati detees.</para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesusa medhay lametidees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Usupun galasappe guye Yesusay Phixirosane Yaqobe qassekka Yaqobe isha Yanisa benara ekidi istara xala issi dhoqa zumma bolla kezidees. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Isti hen dishin Yesusa medhay lametidees, iza ayfezoy awa arshe mala po7idees iza mayoykka po7omala xolqidees. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Herakka Museynne Elasay Yesusara hasa7ishe istas bertidees. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Phixirosay Yesusa “Godo nu hanini dizakko nuss lo7okko, ne shene gidikko issi dasse ness issi dasse Musses issi dasse Elasas hezu dase otho” gidees. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Izi buro hasa7an dishin po7iza sharay ista kamidees, shara gathara, tani izan ufa7etiza ta dosiza ta nay hayssakko izi giza siyitte giza qaala girethi siyetidees. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Iza kalizaytakka hessa siyidi dayamidi ba hu7en bita bolla kundida. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesusay istakkidi shiqidi ista bochidi dendite babofite gidees. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Isti dhoqi gi xelishin Yesusappe atin izara hara ura onaka beybetena. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Isti zumma bollafe wodhishin Yesusay asa nay (tani) hayqoppe dendana gakkanaas inte beyonysa onasikka yotonta mala gi azazidees. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesusa kalizaytikka “Histin Musse woga tamarsizayti Elasay kasetidi yanas bess aazas gizo gidi oychidees. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Izikka istas Elasay tumu yidi wursikka gigisana gidi zaridees. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Gido atin ta intes gizay Elasay yidees gidikkoka asay ba koyda mala iza bolla othidees atin iza eribeyna hessathokka asa nay (tani) isata kushen waye beyana. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Hessa wode Yesusa kalizayti Yesusay isatas yotizaysi xamaqiza Yanisa gish gididays erida.</para>
  <para style="s">Daydanthi oykkida issi na Yesusay pathidees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14-15" style="v"/>Ista garsan diza asakko simida mala issi uray Yesusakko shiqidi iza sinthan gulbatidi Godo ta na daysa bolafe yegiza hargey daro waysiza gish tas marariki daro wode taman kundedees hatha gidonkka geles. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Tani naza nena kalizaytakko ehadis shin isti iza pathana danda7ibeytena gidees. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesusaykka neno amanonta gela yeletazo ayde gakanas ta intenara dane? Qasse ayde gakanas ta intena danda7ane? ane naza ha taakko ehitte gidees. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Hessafe Yesusay daydantha seridi nazappe kesidees, Nazikka hini satteppe simidi paxidees. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesusa kalizayti xalala izakko shiqidi nuni daydantha kesanas aazas danda7ibeykoni? gidi oychida. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Izikka istas intes amanoy pace gidida gish danda7ibeykista ta intes tumu gays qeri gashe ayfe sire amanoy inte bolla dizakone hayssa zuma hayssafe dendada gede ba inte gidakko izi intess bana intena xonanay dena gidees. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Haysa malay gidikko xomanine wosan atin haran kezena <verse number="22" style="v"/>Isti Gelilan issippe dishin Yesusay ista tana asa na asas athi immna <verse number="23" style="v"/>istikka iza wodhana izikka hezantho galas dendana gin iza kalizayti kehi michetida.</para>
  <para style="s">Maqidasse gira qanxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesusayne iza kalizayti Qifirnahome getetiza so gakidappe guye maqidasse gira ekizayti Phixirosakko shiqidi inte astemarey maqidasse gira nam7u dinareza ays qanxene? gida. (issi diranrey he wode issi uras nam7u galasa damoza lagge) <verse number="25" style="v"/>Izikka istas qanxees gidees. Phixirsay keth gelida mala Yesusay kasetidi “Simona dere kawoti gira gidin woykko qaraxa gidin ba naytappe ekizoye haratappe ekiza milatize? gidees. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Phixirosaykka haratappe eketes gides. Yesusaykka histikko nayta bolla acoy ba gidees. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Histikkokka ista nu michisontamala ne mole oykiza yarda ekka bada abana yega, koyro oykkida moleza duna ne poqa demiza issi istatre ekada ta suntharane ne sunthara gira qanxa gidees. (istaterey he wode misha)</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Salo kawotethan wursoppe adanay oone?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>He wode Yesusa kalizayti izakko shiqidi salo kawotethan nu garasan wusofe adhanadey oone gi oychida. <verse number="2-3" style="v"/>Yesusay issi na xeygi ehidi ista gidon essidi “ta intess tummu gays inte simonta ixxikkone gutha nayta mala hannonta ixikko mulekka salo kawoteth gelekista gidees. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Hesa gish ha naza mala bena ziqisizadey salo kawotethan wursofe adhana. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Haysamala gutha na ta sunthan ekizadey tana ekess. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Giddo atin tana amaniza guthatappe isade dhupiza uray dexo woxa shuchu ba qodhen qachetidi aba cimana yegetidi mitetikko izas lo7o gidana. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hana alameya asse dhuphana gasso gidida gish izis ay! dhuphey yuss agena shin dhuphezas gasso gidizades aye! <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ne kushey woykko ne toy nena dhuphanas gaso gidikko neppe qanxa diga ne nam7u keshena woykko nam7u tohora gede medhina taman yegistanappe wobe woykko to sila gidada he gede deyoy dizaso geloy ness lo7ana. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Hessathokka ne ayfey nes dhuphe gidikko neppe kessa yega, nam7u ayfera gede ganame taman ne yegistanaysappe issi ayfera deyo dizaso ne gelizaysi ness lo7o. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Hayta gutha gidoppe issiniyokka inte kadhonta mala nagetite! ta intess tumu gays salon diza ista kitanchati salon ta awa ayfeso wurso galas xeletes. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Asa nay dhaydayta ashans yidees.</para>
  <para style="s">Dhayda dorsa lemuso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ane tass yotitte isi uras xetu dorssi dikko qass istafe issina dhaykko hankko udufun tamane udufuna zumma bolla yegidi dhaydaro koyana bi erene? <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ta intess tumu gays hanqon dhayonta udufun tamane udufun dorsistappe athidi betida dorsayn ufa7etess. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Hessathokka ha guthata garsafe issay dhayana mala salon diza inte awa shene gidana.</para>
  <para style="s">Qohidadees ay othana besizakko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ne isay nena qohikko izakko bada iza xala nenara ekada iza moro izas yota izi ne giza siyikko ne isha ne ass othasa. <verse number="16" style="v"/>izi ne giza siyonta ixikko yoyi wuri nam7u markan woykko hezu markan shatimetiza gish isade woykko nam7u ass nenara ekka bada iza hasa7isa. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Izi istakka siyonta ixikko wosa kethas yota, wosa kistahkka siyonta ixxikko izade ne amamontademe qaraxa shishizade mala qoda. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ta intess tumu gays inte bita bolla qachiday wurikka salonkka qachetida gidana inte bitta bolla birshiday salonkka birshetida gidana. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Qassekka ta intess tumu gays inte bita bolla nam7u gididi ay gishikka ero ero gidi inte oychikko salon diza ta away intess immana. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nam7u woykko hezu gidid ta sunthan inte shizason hen inte gidon ta dana.</para>
  <para style="s">Maro gish</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Hessa wode Phixirosay Yesusakko shiqidi “Godo ta ishay tana qohikko ta izas appun to ato go? lapun to ato go? gidess. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesusaykka izas zaridi lappun tamu to lapun atin lapun to xala ga gike gidees. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Hessa gish salo kawotethi ashikara bolla diza mishe shishana koyda kawo milataysu. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Misha qoda oykidamala iza ashikaratappe daro milione bira achoy iza bolla dizade ekki yida. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ashikaraykka iza bolla diza acoza qanxoy xonxa gish izikka iza machiyakka iza naytinne izas dizaz wuri bayzetidi mishay qanxistana mala iza goday azazidees. <verse number="26" style="v"/>He wode ashikarazi godaza to bolla kundidi tani ta bolla diza acoza ubbaa ness qanxana gakanas tass gutha wode imarkki gidi wosidees. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Iza godaykka izas michetidi iza galeza wirsi maridi yedidees. <verse number="28" style="v"/>He ashikarykka ba goda achappe kezidamala gutha bira (acoy) iza bolla diza ba lage demidine ne bolla diza ta mishayo ha7i hanini qanxa gidi culi oykidees. <verse number="29" style="v"/>He iza lagge ashikary tass gutha wode imarki ta ness qanxana gidi iza to bolla kundidi wosidees. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Gido atin izas gutha wode imanas koyonta ixidi iza laggezi ba bolla diza aco qanxana gakanas woynen yegidees. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Hessa izi othishin be7ida asayne hanko iza lagge ashikarati daro cichetida. Bidikka hanidaysa wursi ba godas yotida. <verse number="32-33" style="v"/>He wode godaz he ashikkara xeygisi ehidi hayso neno itazo ne tana wosin ne bola diza acoza ta ness agadisshin ta nena marida mala nekka ne lageza maranas besne? <verse number="34" style="v"/>Gidi iza bolla diza acoza izi wursi qanxanas gakanas qachana mala qachizaytas athi imidees. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Hesa gish inte issay issa wozinappe maronta agikko salon diza ta awaykka intena marena.</para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesusay eko gishine gelo gish tamarsidees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesusay hasa7i wursidappe guye Galila agidi Yordanose pinthan diza Yihuda awuraja bidees. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Daro derey iza hen kalin izikka harganchata pathidees. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Parsaweti iza pacanas izakko shiqidi ay gasonkka assi ba machcho anjana besize? gidi oychida. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Izikka istas Xoossi koyroppe macane adene medhidaysa nababibeyketi? gidess. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Qassekka assi awane ayo agidi ba machchira issippe gidees, nam7anykka issi asho gidetes getetidaysi hayssa gedon gidene? gidess. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nam7ay issi asho atin sinthafe namyu gidetena. Hessa gish Xoossi gathi waxidaysa assi shakofo. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Istika izas histin Musey assi ba machcho anjidi anjo waraqata izis immidi yedo gidi aazas azazide? gida. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesusaykka istas Musey inte wozina mumeteth beydi machcheta inte anjana mla fiqde intes imides atin koyroppe hessamala gidena gidees. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ta intess tummu gays ba azinappe hara urara laymatonta dishin ba machcho anjidi hararo machcho ekizadey wuri laymates izikka gidees, anjetidarokka ekizadey izira laymates. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesusa kalizayti izas machi wogayne azina wogay hayssamala gidikko machcho ekonta agoy lo7o gida. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Gido atin Yesusay istas issi issi istas imetida asatappe atin hayssa timirteza onikka ekkanas danda7ena gidees. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Gasoykka issi issi asay ba ayi uloppe yeletishe guddula gididi yeletes, issi issi asay asa kushen qaeatetidi gundilees, issi issi asay salo kawotethas gidi bena berka gudila othiza asikka dees. Haysa ekanas danda7izdey eekoo.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusay gutha nayta anjidees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Qassekka yesusay ista bolla ba kushe wothidi wosana mala gutha nayta izakko ekki ehida gido attin iza kalizayti nayta ehida asata bolla hanqettida. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesusay nayta ha taakko yero digofitee, salo kawotethi haytanta malasa gidees. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Be kushe nayta bolla wothidi anjidappe guye heppe denddi bidees.</para>
  <para style="s">Natetha dure adeza oycha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hessappe qasse issi uray Yesusakko shiqidi “tamarsizayso medhina de7o demanas demans ta lo7o otho ayi otho? gidi oychidees. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesusaykka tana aazas lo7o gish oychazi? Lo7oy isade xala, gede de7oy dizaso ne gelana koykko azazota naga gidees. <verse number="18-19" style="v"/>Adezikka azazoti awayte? gidi oychidees. Yesusaykka zaridi “assi wodhoppa laymatoppa kaysotoppa wordo markatoppa ne awane ne ayo boncha ne shoro ne mala siqa gidees. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Wodalazikka zaridi hayssa ubbaa ta nagadis haray azi tas pacide? gidees. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesusaykka zaridi ne mule xilanakoykko bada ne haridaz ubbaa bayzada misha wursi manqotas imma neni salon mishe demandasa hessappe guye simma yada tana kala gidees. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Addezikka hessa siyidi izas daro mishi diza gish kehippe mishetishe bidees. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesusaykka bena kalizata ta intes tumu gays dureti salo kawoteth gelaysi daro meto gidees. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Qassekka ta intes gizay durey salo kawoteth gelanaysappe gamelay narfe lukora adhethi kawusha gida gidees. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Hessa siyida iza kalizayti dar qopidi histin oni atana danda7ize gidi Yesusa oychida. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesusaykka ista xelidi “haysi asa achan dandaetena Xoossa achan gidikko wurikka danda7etes gidees. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Phixirosaykka izas zaridi “nu nursikka agidi nena kalidos histin ha7i nu ayi demanesha gidees. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesusaykka istas ta intess tumu gays asa nay buro yana oratha alamen ba boncho zupane bola utiza wode inte tan lakidayti tamane nam7u zupanne bola utidi tamane nam7u Isra7ele nayta bolla pirdana. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ta suntha gish gidi ba keth, ba ishata ba michista ba awane ba ayo ba nayta woykko ba bitta agiza assi wuri xetu kushe dikko ekkana medhina deyo latana. <verse number="30" style="v"/>gido attin daro snthe gidida asati guye gidana, daro guyen diza asati sinthana.</para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Woyne miththaso othiza othanchata lemuso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Salo kawotethi ba woyne atakiltte gidon othan othanchata qaxaranas maladora kezida issi akakilitey diza gadadade milataysu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Issi galasa damuza gidizaz hasa7etidi gigidappe guye othanchata woyne akakilte otho oythidees. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Malado hezu saten kezidi othoy baynda mela giyay eqizason eqida hara asata demidees. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Inte bidi ta woyne gidon othite ta intes besiza mishe immana gidees. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Istika bida. Qassekka galasappe usuppun satenine udufun sate bolla kezidi hara othanchata othon gelithidees. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Omarsa wode tamane issi sate gidiza wode kezidi coo eqidayta harata demidi inte kumetha galas othoy baynda aazas hayssan eqeti gidi oychidees. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Istika nuna othisiza asi dhayda gish eqidos gida. Izikka ista intekka bidi ta woyne akakilte gidon othite gidees. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Gadey qamishin woyneza akakilteza goday othancha halafezas guyfe yidaytappe oykkada koyro yidayta gakans diza othnchata wurso xeygada ista otho waga qanxa gidees. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Tamane isintha sate bolla othon gelidayti yidi isay isay kumetha galasa waga ekkida. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Koyro othon gelidayti yishe ba wozinara hinkoytappe bollara daro demmna gi qopishin istasikka hinkoytara gina imidees. <verse number="11-12" style="v"/>Misha ekishe qanxizade bolla hayti wursethan othon gelidi issi sate xala othidayti kumetha galasa othon daburidine awan xugetidi pe7ida nusara wosta istas issi gina qanxay gida. <verse number="13-14" style="v"/>Izikka istafe issi ade ta jalaw nena qohabeykke issi galasas gidiza damuzen othanas tanara gigabeyki? ha7i he7i ne gisha ekada ba, ness imidaysa sire wursethan yidaysasikka ta immana koyays. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Histin ta mishan ta dosidaz othanas danda7ikina? woykko ta kiya gididaysi nena miqaynsize? gidees. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hessa gish guyen dizayti sinthe, sinthen dizayti guye adhana.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusay ba hayqo gish hezantho yotidees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesusay Yeruslame bishe bena kaliza tamane nm7ata duma ekidi hiz gidees. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Hi7a nuni Yerusalame bana gos asa nay qesista halaqasine Muse woga tamarsizaytas adhi immistana istikka izi hayqana mala iza bolla pirdana. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Iza bolla qidhi ka7anasine garafana mala wodhana malakka deretas athi immana hezantho galas izikka hayqoppe dendana.</para>
  <para style="s">Zabidosa nayta ayeyi oycha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Hessappekka Zabidosa nayta aya ba naytara Yesusakko shiqada iza sinthan gulbatada izi izis issi miish othana mala wosadus. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Izikka izo ay koyazi gidees, izakka hayti ta na nam7ati ne kawotethan isay ne oshachara issay ne hadirsara utana mala otharki gadus. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesusaykka zaridi inte wosizaz erekista tani uyiza xu7a inte uyana danda7ane? gidees. Istika E danda7os gida. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Izikka ta xu7appe tummu inte uyanashin ta ushachanine ta hadirsan utethi ta away gigisidadentas atin tani imizaz dena gidees. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Tamati hessa siyidi nam7u ishata bolla hanqettida. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesusay ista issi bolla xeygidi dere harizayti ba hariza dere bolla godatizaysamala godatethi dizayti wolqara harizaysa inte ereta gidees. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Inte garsan hessa mala hananas besena intefe gita gidana koyzadey intes othizade gido. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Intefe bolla gidanas koyzadey intefe garse gido. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Asa nay asay izas othana mala gidonta asas othanasine ba shemppo darota gish athi immanas yidees.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusay ayfe qoqe nam7ata pathidees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesusay bena kalizatara Yarikofe kezidi bishin daro derey iza kalidees. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Hen ayfey qoqida nam7u asati oge dunad utidi detees. Yesusay adhizaysa siyidi Godo Dawite no nuna mara gidi wasida. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Derey hayzite gidi hanqidees, gido attin isti camo waso wasishe Godo Dawite no nuna mara gida. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesusaykka eqidi ista xeygidi ta intes ay othana mala koyeti? gidees. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Istika nu ayfey xelanamala koyos gida. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesusaykka istas michetidi ista ayfetakka ba kushera bochechin herakka xelidi iza kalida.</para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesusay gita bonchora Yersalame gelidees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Isti Yerusalame matan Debirezayte zuma bolla diza Betefage getetizaso gakidamala Yesusay bena kalizaytappe nam7ata kitidees. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Hano inte matan diza mandarayo bidi inte he gakida mala issi hare dizara ba guteyra qachista dishin inte demana. Birshidi ha taakko ekki yite. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Onikka intena aysi hayssatho otheti gikko Goday ista koyes gite, intena oychizadey herakka yedana. <verse number="4-5" style="v"/>Haysikka hanizay kase naben na Xiyonis hizgite “Hekko ne kawoy ashikke gididi hareyone hareyo guteyo togidi neekko yana getetidaysi polistanasa” gidees. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Iza kalizayti Yesusay istas yotida mala othida. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hareyo izi guteyra ehidi ba mayo ista bolla wothin izikka harista togidees. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Derappe dariza bagay ba mayo ogge bolla micidees, baga asay miththa bonco duthi duthi ogge bolla athi athi yegidees. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Izappe sinthara biza dereyne guyera kaliza dereykka ba qaala dhuqu histidi Dawite nay galateto! Goda sunthan yiday anjetidade! Xoossi galateto! gida. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Izi Yerusalame gelida wode katama asay wuri haysi oone? gidi yark yarkidees. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Iza kalidi yida dereykka hasi Galila garsan diza Nazireteppe yida Nabe Yesusa gidene gidees.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusay Maqidasen zal7e zal7iza asa godidees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12-13" style="v"/>Hessappe Yesusay maqidasse gelidi maqidasse lasah gathan bayzizaytane shamizayta godidees. Misha lamizayta xaraphezaka haraphe bayzizayta oyde shiri shiri yegidi ta kethay wosa keth getetes getetidi xafetidees inte qas bonqizayta aqoso histidista gidees. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ayfe qoqistane toy silida asata Yesusakko maqidase ehida. Izikka ista pathidees. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Gido atin qesista halaqatine Muse woga tamarsizayti izi othida malalatane woze kawo galatay dawute nas giddo gidi wasiza gutha nayta beyidi daro hanqetidees. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Istika Yesusa hayti nayti gizaysa siyay? gida Yesusaykka istas E siyadis, Nayta dunappene dhamiza qeri nayta dunan ta galata gigisadis gizaso mulerakka nababi ereketi? gidees. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ista yegi agidi he katamappe kezidi bitanya gizaso bidi hen eqidees.</para>
  <para style="s">Ayfey baynda balase mithiyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesusay wontetha galas malado guye katama simishin iza gafisidees. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Oge matan issi balase giza mith beydi gede izikko shiqishin haythe xalafe atin ayfey bayndaysa beydi “Hi7appe ne bolla ayfey doppo gin balase miththay herakka meladus. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesusa kalizayti hessa byidine malaletidi hana balaseya wanada heraka melade gida. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesusaykka ista ta intes tumu gays intes amanoy dikone inte sidhonta agikko balase miththay bolla hanidaysa mala xala gidonta hayssa zumma hayssafe dhoqalistada duge aban gela inte gidakoka izi gelana gidees. <verse number="22" style="v"/>intess amanoy dikko inte wosan oychida miish wursikka ekana.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusa godatetha gish shiqida oycha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesusay maqidasse gelidi tamarsishin qesista halaqatine dere cimati izako shiqidi hayssa wursi ona shenen otahzi? hayssa otahanas shene ness oni imide? gidi iza oychida. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesusaykka istas zaridi takka intena issino oychays inte tass zariko takka ha ta othizayta ona shenen othizakone takka intess yotana <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yanisa xinqatey awappe yide? Saloppe yideye asappe? gidees. Istika nu saloppe yidees gikko histin aazas amanibeyketi? gana gidi ba garsan issay issara zoretida. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Qasse nu asappe gikko asay wurikka Yanisa nabe gidi amaniza gish nu babos. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Hessa gish Yesusas nu eroko gidi zarida izikka istas hayta ta othizata onna shenen othizakone takka intes yotikke gidees.</para>
  <para style="s">Namm7u nayta lemuso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesusay ista hiz gidees intes ay milatiz namm7u atumma nay diza issadey des izikka koyro nazakko bidi ta nazo hach gede woyne miththaso bada otha gidees. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Nazi qasse bikke gidine guyeppe muzetidi bidees. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Namm7antho nazakka kaseysathokka ba gin nazi ero gidi bonta aga gidees. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Hayta namm7atappe awwa shene poliday awaysse? Isstikka koyro naza gida. Yesusaykka istass ta intess tummu gays qaraxa shishizaytane laymatizayti salo kawotethi intefe sinte gelana. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Xamaqiza Yanisay intena xilotetha ogge besanas intekko yidess shin inte izi giza amanibeykkista gido attin qaraxa shishizaytine layamatizati gidikko amanida izi hanidazi inte beyi simidikka marotethan gelidi amanibeykkista.</para>
  <para style="s">Woyne miththa gidon othiza goshancha lemuso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Hara lemusokka siyitte woyne mith tokizasoy dizadey he woynezas birda yushi athidi woyneza ayfe gum7anas olla bokkidees. Woyneza naganas miththa bolla shakko gigisidees. Hessappe guye bita woyne miththara goyzaytas kira immidi hara dere bidees. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Boney gakishin woyneza ayfe ekanas ba ashikarata bitta goyzaytakko yedidees. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Bitta goyzayti ashikarata oykidi issa wodhida issa qasse shuchan cadida. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Gada goday kaseytappe adhiza hara ashikarata yedidees. Goyzayti ha7ikka kaseyta bolla othidaysamalakka ista bollakka polida. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Wursethan oni eri isti izas babanakone gidi ba na athi yedidees. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Gido atin bita goyzayti naza be7idamala “Haysi iza latanaysakko, ane ha yite iza wodhidi bitta latos gida. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Naza oykidi woyney toketidasoppe gede kare kessidi wodhida. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Ero woyneza goday yiza wode he bitta goyiza asata itess wositana milati? <verse number="41" style="v"/>Istika heytanta itata daro waysi wodhidi woyney toketiza gadappe besiza woyne ayfe wodera izas immiza hara gade goyzaytass kirasana gidi izas zarida. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Yesusaykka istas “Gesha maxafan gimbe kexizayti iita gidi wora yegida shuchay kethas wana hu7e gidees, Xoossi hayssa othidees, iza othoykka nu ayfes malalisizaz, geteti xafetidaysa nababibeyketi? gidees. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Hessa gish ta intess Xoossa kawotethi intefe ekistada ayfe ayfiza deretass immistana gidees. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Haysa shucha bolla kundizay meqana shuchaykka iza bolla wodhizadeykka liqana. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Qessista halaqatine Parisaweti iza lemuso lemusoy ista gish gididaysa erida. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Gido atin isti iza oyki qaphonta mala asay Yesusa nabe mala xelizagish babidees.</para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Sarge digisa lemuso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Qassekka Yesusay hara lemuso hizgidi yotidees. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Salo kawotethi ba nas sarge gigisida issi kawo milataysu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kawoykka digisas yotidayta xeyganas ba ashikarata yedidees, xegetidaytikka nu bokko gida. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Qassekka hara ashikarata kasse istas yotidayta hekko ta sanga boratanne handaida mehista shukada digisa gigisadis, wurikka gigetida gish sargeso hayitte gidi yotite. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Xeygetidayti gidikko iza xeysa wudan yegonta agidi issay ba goshaso issay ba zal7eso bidees. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Hankko atidayti ashikarat oykidi daro waysidi wodhida. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kawoykka hanqetidi olizayta yedidi ashikara wodhidayta dhaysidees, issta katama xugidees. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Be ashkaratakka “Sargeza digisay gigidees, gido attin sargezaso xeygetidayti sarges besizayta gidibeytena. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Gede ogge bolla kezidi inte demida assi wursi ha sargge digisas xeygitte. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ashkaratikka ogge bolla kezidi ba demidayta lo7otakka itatakka wurssi shishidi sargeza keth imath kunthida. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kawoykka xeygetida imatha beyanas keth geliza wode sarge mayo mayonta ura demidees. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yalo sarge moyo mayonta wanada hayssa gelanas danda7adi gi oychin adezas zarana qalay dhaydees. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kawoykka ba ashkarata hayssa adeza tone kushe shishi qachidi hen karen diza dhumana kessi olitte hen yehoynne acha garcechi gidana gidees. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Xeygetidayti darota doretidayti gidikko guthata.</para>
  <para style="s">Gira qanxanas shiqida oycho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hessappe guye Parisaweti kezi bishe iza dunappe bala qaala wosti demi oykino gidi zoretida. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Bena kalizayti Herodosa asatara izakko izakko “astamare neni tumanchane Xoossa ogge tumappe tamarsizade gididaysane onasikka dumma mado othonta wursiqa issi mala ne xelizaysa nu eros” gidees. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ness ay misatizakkone ane nus yota qesares gira qanxanas besize? nesene? <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesusaykka ista gene qofa eridi “inteno qodheppe qomoto tana yon balethi oykanas aazas koyeti? gidees. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Inte gira qanxiza misha anne tana besite gin istikka issi dinare giza miish izas ehida. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Izikka hayssa misha bolla diza misiley onayse? xafey onayse gidees. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Istika izas qesareysa gida. Izikka istas zaridi qesareysa qesares Xoossisa Xoossas imite gidees. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Hessa siyida wode malaletidine iza agagidi bida.</para>
  <para style="s">Hayqidayta dentha gish shiqida oycha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Hayqidaytas dendoy bawa gidi amaniza saduqaweti he galas Yesusakko shqidi hizgi oychida. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Tamarsizaso Mussey issi uray machcho ekidi na yelonta hayqikko iza ishay hayqidaysa machcho ekidi ba isha latiza na yelo gidees. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nu achan lappun ishati detes shin koyro ishay machcho ekidi na yelonta hayqida gish kaallo ishay iza machchiyo ekidees. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Namm7antho ishaykka hayqida ishatho na yelonta hayqidees, hessathokka hanishin macashaya lappuntha isha geladus. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Wursethan macashaya hayqadus. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Hessa gish lappunati wurikka izo ekkida shin hayqoppe dentha galas macashaya lappuntappe awaysa machcho gidane? <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesusaykka istas zaridi “Gesha maxafatanne Xoossa wolqa inte eronta gish inte baletista” gidees. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Hayqoppe dendidappe guye asay sallo kitanchata mala gidana atin eketenane geletena. <verse number="31-32" style="v"/>Hayqidayta dentha gish gidikko Xoossi tani Abrame Xoossa Yisaqa Xoossa Yaqobe Xoossa gidi intes yotoysa nababibeyketi? Xoossi paxata Xoossa atin hayqethata Xoossu gidena. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Derykka hessa siyidi iza timirtezan malaletidees.</para>
  <para style="s">Wusoppe adhiza azazo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesusay Saduqawista co7u hisitidaysa siyidi Parsaweti issi bola shiqetida <verse number="35-36" style="v"/>Ista garsafe issi Musse woga lo7ethi erizadey Yesusa pacanas koydi “astamare Musse wogata garsan wurosoppe adhizay awaysse? gidi oychidees. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Izikka zaridi ne Godaa Xoossa ne kumetha wozanappe, ne kumetha shempefe, ne kumetha qofappe dossa. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Haysi koyronne wursoppe adhiza azazo. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Namm7anthoykka iza milates, hesikka ne shoro ne hu7e mala dossa gizaysa. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Musse wogayne nabeta timirtey wurikka hayata namm7u azazotan qachetes.</para>
  <para style="s">Krstosay ona nakone shiqida oycho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Parsaweti issi bolla shiqeti dishin Yesusay ista <verse number="42" style="v"/>Kirstosa gish intess ay geti? Izi nona na? gi oychidees, istikka izas zaridi izi Dawite na gida. <verse number="43-44" style="v"/>Izikka istas “histin Dawitey Xillo ayana wolqan “Xoossau ta Godda ta ne morketa ne to garsan gulbatisana gakanas ne ta oshachan uta aazas gidde? <verse number="45" style="v"/>Hessa gish Dawitey iza ta Goda gidi xegikko wanidi izas na gidana danda7ize? <verse number="46" style="v"/>Izas issi qaala zarana danda7ida uray woykko he galassappe simiin iza oycho oychana xalida uray onikka betibeynna.</para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesusay Parsawistane Musse woga tamarsizayta kadhidees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Qassekka Yesusay derezasine bena kalizatas hiz gidees; <verse number="2" style="v"/>Musse woga tamarsizaytinne Parsaweti Musse wonbara bolla utida <verse number="3" style="v"/>Hessa gish isti intess yotizaysa wursi othitene nagite gido attin isti dunan hasa7izaysa mala othon besonta gish inte ista otho kalofite. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Hessathokka assi tookanas danda7onta dexo toho qachidi asa hashe bolla wothetes shin bess gidkko biradhe xerankka bochetena. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ista otho wursi assi beyana mala othetes, ba ashenkintabe (maxafa garsappe xafi ekida issi issi xiqisista kitabe sikidi liphe bolla woykko kushen qachizaz) oothetees. Be mayo macara adusetees. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Gibizay dizason boncho so mukurabenkka sinthara utana dosetes. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hesathokka giya gidon saro getistanasine asay issta astamarento gana mala koyetees. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Inte gidikko astamare geteti xegetoppitte, inte astamarey issa xala gidishin inte wurikka issay issas ishnta. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Salon intess aaaway xala diza gish bitta bolla onakka awa gidi xegoppitte. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Inte astemarey issi kirstosa xala gidida gish inte “astemarento” getopitte. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Inte garsan wursoppe adhizadey intess othizade gidana. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Bena dhoqisizadey kawuyana, bena kawushizadey bonchetana. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Inteno qodheppe qomoto Musse woga tamarsizayte, inteno Parsaweto asay Xoossa kawoteth gelonta mala asa bolla inte penge gordiza gish intena aye? Inte intes gelekistane gelanas koyzaytakka gelthekista. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Inteno qodheppe qomoto Musse woga tamarsizayto qassekka Parsaweto intena aye! azinay baynda macashata ketha kalosishe asa ayfe sinthan adusa wossa inte wosiza gish inte iita pirda pirdistana. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Inteno qodheppe qomoto (dunan cimzayto) Musse woga tamarsizayto qasseka Parsaweto issi ura ayhude amanon gelthanas abba bollarane bitta bollara yuyi daburdine amanthida asa intefe nam7u kushe athidi ganame na inte kesiza gish intena aye. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Inteno intees qoqi utidi harata kalethizayto intena aye! Onikka maqidassen caqiko aykoy ba gido attin maqidasse gido diza worqan caqiko caqo gomey gakana gista. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Inteno qoqidayto baletidayto worqafene worqa dumathida awaysi adhize? <verse number="18" style="v"/>Hesathokka onikka yarsho yarshizaso bolla caqiko aykoy ba shin yarshizaso diza yarsho bolla caqikko caqoy gomes gista. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Inteno qoqeto yarshoppene yarsho shishizasoppe awaysse adhizay? <verse number="20" style="v"/>Hessa gish yarsho shishizaso bolla caqizadey yarsho soza bollane yarshizaso bolla diza miish wurson caqess. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Hessathokka maqidasseza bolla caqiday maqidasanine iza gidon aqizaysan <verse number="22" style="v"/>Salon caqizadeykka Xoossa alganine algga bolla utidaysan caqees. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Inteno qodheppe qomoto Musse woga tamarsizayto Parsaweto intena aye! Assotappene anugappe katkal7appe tamappe issino immista shin wogatappe wanatizayta heytikka tuma firda, marotethine ammaneteth gidikko kadhidista. Heyta agonta dishe haytanta inte othanas intes besess shin agidista. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Inteno qoqe kalethoto u7e gaccidi uyista shin gamela mume mitista. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Inteno qodheppe qomon hanizayto Musse woga tamarsizaytone Parsaweto intena aye! Xu7asine keres bolla baga qucista shin iza gidon dizaysa inte bonqanine uzetethan shisidista. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Neno qoqe Parsawezo koyrotada xu7asine keres garsa baga gesha, hessappe guye kare bagay kesh gidana. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Inteno qodheppe qomoto Musse woga tamarsizayto qasse Parsaweto bolla baga norara meshetidi lo7izayti gidoy gidikko hayqidayta meqethine daro tunanetethan kumida dufota milatiza gish intena aye! <verse number="28" style="v"/>Intekka bolla bagara asaas xilo asata milatista, inte gidoy gidikko dumma cimonine itatethan kumidess. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Inteno dunan cimizayto Musse woga astemareto qsekka Parsaweto inetena aye! Nabista dufo lo7othizayto xillo asata dufo hawultera gigisizato, <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nu awati nagista wodhiza wode nu dizakko istara zuppetokoko shin, <verse number="31" style="v"/>Inte nabeta wodhida asata nayta gididaysa inte dunara interka inte inte bolla markatista. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Histikko othetishe poletonta ogge bolla diza inte aawata otho politte, <verse number="33" style="v"/>Inteno dukiza ita shosha nayto ganame tamma pirdappe inte wani atane? <verse number="34" style="v"/>Hessa gish nabetane eranchata astamaristakka ta intess yedana, inte ista garsappe issi issi asata wodhana, bagayta inte kaqana, bagyta inte mukuraben garafanane ha katamappe hara inte godana. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Hessa gish xillo Abele suthafe ha simin maqidasenine yarsho so gidon inte wodhida Barakiyo na Zakarasa sutha gakanas bitta bolla gukida xillota sutha wursos inte oychistana. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Ta intess tumu gays kasse adhida yo wursos haysi ha yeletay oychistana. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Hane Yursalame nabeta wodhizare neekko kitetidayta shuchara cadizare cadizare hanne Yurusalemekuto aya ba ciyista ba qefe gido shishiza mala ta ne nayta shishanas apun wode koyadina shin inte gidikko koybeykista. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Hekko inte kethi kays gidi atana. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Ta intess tumu gays inte Goda sunthan yizadey anjetidade gana wodey gakanas nmm7antho tana beyekista.</para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Wode wusetha malatata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesusay maqidasse kezi bishin iza kalizayti maqidase shucha ketha iza bessana koyidi izakko shiqida. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Izikka istas hayasa wursi xeletti? Ta intess tumu gays haysi inte beyza isay issa bola diza shuchay laletonta issi shchikka hayssatho deyena gidees. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Izi Dabirazayte getetiza zumma bolla uti dishin iza kalizayti xala izakko shiqidi ane nus yota haysi ne gizaysi ayde hanane? Ne yusasine wode wursethas malatay aze gi oychida. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesusaykka zaridi oikka intena balethonta mala nagetite. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Buro daroti ta kirstosa gishe ta sunthan yana, darotakka balethana. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ollane olla gish carkotiza worekka inte siyana. Ha yoti wurikka wolqara polistana shin wursethi buro gidida gish inte hayssan dagamonta mala nagetite. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Derey dere bolla kawoy kawo bolla dendana, dumma dumma deren koshayne bitta qathi hanana. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Hessi wurikka mixas lesso mala. <verse number="9" style="v"/>He wode intena wayes athi immana, intena wodhana, ta suntah gedon dere wurson inte ixetidayta gidan. <verse number="10" style="v"/>He wode daro asay dhuphistana, issay issa athi athi immanane ba garsan ixistana. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Daro wordo nabeti dendanane darota balethana <verse number="12" style="v"/>Itatethi dariza gish darotappe siqoy irxana. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Wurseth gakanas minida uray atana. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Dere wursos marka gidana mala haysi kawotetha wungilay kumetha alamen yotistana, hessappe guye wursethi yana. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hessa gish nabe Danelan yotetidaysa mala “dhayso tunatethi anjetidason” eqidaysa inte beyza wode (nababizadey wozinan wotho). <verse number="16" style="v"/>He wode Yihudan dizayti pude zumma bolla gangeto. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ketha kara bolla dizadey onikka ba miish kethafe kessana gidi duge wodhofo. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Gade gidon dizadey onikka ba mayo ekka gidi so simofo. <verse number="19" style="v"/>He galasatan qanthara diza macashatasine na dhanthiza ayistas aye! <verse number="20" style="v"/>Hessa gish inte gangoy balgo woykko sanbata galas gidonta mala wositte. <verse number="21" style="v"/>He wode alamey medhetosoppe hachi gakanas hani eronta mishi sinthafekka iza milatizay baynda wolqama metoy hanana. <verse number="22" style="v"/>He galasti qamontakko asho mayida assi wuri atenashin doretidayta gish he galasati qamana. <verse number="23" style="v"/>He wode onikka hekko kirstosi hayssan dess, woykko hessan dess giza ura amanopitte. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Wordo kirstosayne wordo nabeti buro denda istas danda7etikko doretidayta balethans gidi wolqama malatatane kasse otheti eronta miish othana. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Hekko hayssa intes kasista yotays. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Hessa gish hekko hirki bazon dess gidi intess yotikko he kezobitte, hekko ilppinen dess gikko amanoppitte. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Wolqanthi away mokizasora wolqamidi away wulizaso gakanas po7izaysa mala asa na yusaykka hessaththo hanana. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Ahay dizaso anko kafoy shiqees. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Herakka he ita meto galasatappe guye awa arshey dhumana, aginay ba po7o digana, xolinteti saloppe qoqefistana, salo wolqamatikka qaxana. <verse number="30" style="v"/>He wode asa na malatay salo bolla bistana, bitta bolla diza derey wuri yekkana, asa naykka salo shara bolla daro wolqarane gita bonchora yishin asay beyna. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Kitanchatakka daro wolqama xurumba girethara yedana. Istika doretidayta oydu mezanappe salo gaxa issafe hara issi baga gaxa shishana. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Balase giza miththafe hayssa tamaritte, balase miththays unquloy cililiza wode iza haythe kesishin hessa wode boney matidaysa inte ereta. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Hesatho hayta inte beyza wode izi pengen matidaysa inte erana. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Ta tumu gays haysi wuri polistana gakanas ha yeletay adhena. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Saloy bittay adhana shin ta qalay gidikko mulekka adhena.</para>
  <para style="s">Goday yana galas onikka erena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>He galasyone he sateyo aawappe atin salo kitanchata gidinkka naza gidinkka oonikka erena. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Nohe wode handaysa mala asa na yussi hessa mala gidana. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Dhaysa hathafe kasse Nohey markaben geliza galas gakanas asay mishene uyishe, ekishene gelishe gam7idees. <verse number="39" style="v"/>He wodey gakanas azzi hananakone asay erontane hasa7ay baynda basha hathay yidi mitidaysa mala ta asanay yiza wodeykka hessaththo hanana. <verse number="40" style="v"/>He wode nam77u asati issippe goshan pey7ana shin istafe issadey ekistana, issadey atana, <verse number="41" style="v"/>Namm7u macashati woxan issippe gacana shin istafe issiniya ekkistana issiniya attana. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Histikko inte Goday yana galasa inte eronta gish begidi nagite. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Haysa wozinan wothite, kaysoy qamappe appuntha sate bolla yanakone erizakko iza miish kaysoy ekonta mala ketha aaway begidi nagana. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Assa naykka inteqopponta sate bolla yana intekka hessaththo gigetidayta gidite. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Wodera so asa qumma mizana mala goday ba ketha asa bolla shuumida amanetiza cinca oothanchay one? <verse number="46" style="v"/>Kethaaway simidi yiza wode izas immida hadara othipolishe betida oothanchay anjetidaysa. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Ta intess tummu gays Goday iza ba harida wurso bolla shuumes, <verse number="48" style="v"/>Gido atin he othanchay iita gididi ta goday gam7idi yana gidi <verse number="49" style="v"/>dendidi hankko othanchata wadha oykidi mathotizaytara mikkone uykko <verse number="50" style="v"/>izi qopponta qopponta saten iza Goday yidi <verse number="51" style="v"/>iza qanxethi ka7ana, iza exxa qodheppe qomora othizaytara othana. Henikka yehoyne acha garcethi hanana.</para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Tammu gelapta lemuso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>He wode salo kawotethi mishira mokanas xomppe oykidi kezida tammu gellaota milataysu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>He tammatappe ichachu gela7oti eyata, hankko ichachati qasse eraata. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Eyati kuraze xomppe oykida shin wurikko qolana hara nagge lamba oykibeytena. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Erati gidkko ba kurazezara wurikko gujana lagge lammba hara xarmusen oykidda. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Machiyo ekkana mishiray yonta gam7in dhiskoy dexin asay wurikka dhiskidees. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Gidi gidoth gidishin mishrazi yes kezidi moki ekitte giza xeyssa qalay siyetidees. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hessa wode gela7oti wurikka dendidi ba xomppe xomppe oythethone gigeteth oykida. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Dogati erata nu xomppey to7ana giza gish inte lambappe nus immitte gida. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Era gela7oti istas zaridi nuss diza lambay nusara intessaranne intesara gidonta gish bidi lamba bayzizaytappe intess shamitte gida. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Isti lamba shamna bida wode mishrazi gakiwodhidees. Kasse gigeti utidda gela7oti bulacha so izara gelida, kareykka gordetidees. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Guth gam7ishe hakko gela7oti yidi “Godo Godo kare nuss doy7a” gida. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Izikka zaridi “ta intess tumu gays ta intena erikke” gidees. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Hessa gish yana galasa woykko sateza inte eronta gish gigetidi nagite.</para>
  <para style="s">Azala ashikkara lemuso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Xoossa kawotethi bess dizaz wursi ba ashikaratas hadara immidi hara dere bana dendida issi ass milatees. <verse number="15" style="v"/>ashikaratas isas issas istta wolqama mala gigisidi issas ichachu shi birra, issas namm7u shi bira, hankoysas qasse issi shi birra immidi bidees. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ichachu shi birra ekida adezi herakka mishan zal7e oykidi hara ichachu shi birra tirpisidees. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Qssekka namm7u shi birra ekidaysi hara namm7u shi birra wodhisidees. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Issi shi birra ekidaysi ba goda bira bitan magidi qotidees. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ashikarata goday ba bidason daro wode gamm7i simidi misha istara shalagetidees. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ichachu shi birra ekida ashikaray hara ichachu shi birra wodhsidaysa ekki yidi godo ne tass ichachu shi birra imadasa shin hekko hayssa ta harra ichachu shi bira wodhisadis gidees. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Iza godaykka lo7o othadasa neno lo7o ammanetida ashikarazo ne gutha mishan amanetida ass gidida gish ta nena daro misha bolla shuumana, gede ne goda ufaysaso gela gidees. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Hessathokka namm7u shi birra ekkidaysi godazakko shiqidi godo ne tass namm7u shi birra immadasa shin hekko hara namm7u shi birra wodhisadis gidees. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Godazikka lo7ethadasa hayso loo7one tass ammanetida ashikarazo neni guthan amanetidade gidida gish ta nena daro misha bolla shuumays, gede ne goda ufaysaso gela gidees. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Issi shi birra ekkida ashikaray sniqidi godo neni zeronta soppe maxizadene lalonta soppe shishiza minxe iita ass gididaysa ta erays. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Hessa gish ta babada bitta bokkada ne birra bokkida ollan mogada qotadis, ne miish nesssa beya he7i gidees <verse number="26" style="v"/>Iza goday zaridi hayso iita azala ashikarazo tani zerontasoppe maxizade lalontasoppe shishizade gididaysa ne eray? <verse number="27" style="v"/>Histin ta simma yiza wode ta misha yelora ta ekkana mala tirpisi zal7iza asas ne immanas besseseshin gidees. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Ane ha7i iza shi birra ekidi tammu shi biray dizadess immitte. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Dizades gujistanane dari dari bana bayndadeppe he diza guthayiyakka izappe ekista gidana. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Haysa go7ay baynda ashikara gede yekizasone achey garcetizaso heni karen diza dhumman kesi yegitte gidees.</para>
  <para style="s">Wursetha pirda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Assa nay ba kitanchata wursora bonchon yiza wode ba boncho zuppane bolla utana. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Derey wuri iza sinthi shiqana izikka mehe hemiza uray desh dorsappe qori shkiza mala asa issa issape qori shakana. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Dorsata izas oshacha bagara deshata hadirsa bagara essana. <verse number="34" style="v"/>He wode kawoy oshacha bagara dizayta “inte ta aaway intena anjidayti ha yite, alamey medhetosoppe intes gigetida kawotetha latitte gana. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Gasoykka tani gafin tana muzidista, ta sametin tana ushidista, ta immatha gidada yin tana moki ekidista. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Ta kalotin tana mayzidista, ta saketin tana hargisidista, ta qashetin tana oychidista. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Xillotikka zaridi “Godo ne gafin nena ayde muzidoni?, woykko ne samotin ayde beydi nena ushidoni? <verse number="38" style="v"/>Nu ayde nena beydi immathateth mokidoni? woykko ayde ne kalotin beydi nena mayzidoni? <verse number="39" style="v"/>Hessathokka ne saketin woykko qachetin ayde beydi nena oychidoni gana. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Kawoykka zaridi ta intes tumu gays hayta lafa gidida ta ishatappe isades inte tass othida mala gana. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Qassekka hadirsa bagara dizaytas inteno qangetidayto tappe shaketidi Dabulosasine iza kitanchatas gigetida medhina taman bitte gana. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Gasoykka ta gafin tana muzibeykkista, ta samotin tana ushibeykista, <verse number="43" style="v"/>tana immathateth mokibeykista. ta kalotin tana mayzibeyketta, ta saketinine qashetin tana oychibeyketta. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Istika zaridi godo ne gafin woykko ne samotin woykko ne immath gidin woykko ne kalotinine ne sakketin woykko ne qachetin nu nenna beydi ayde ness gakibeykoni? gana. <verse number="45" style="v"/>He wode izikka istas zaridi ta intees tumu gays haninta lafa ta ishatappe issadees inte othonta agidaysi tass inte othonta agida mala gana. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Heyti gede medhina pirdan bana xilota gidikko medhina deyokko bana.</para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ayhudati Yesusa wodhanas maqetida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v"/>Yesusay hessa hasa7i wursidappe guye bena kalizaytas namm7u galasappe guye paziga gididaysa ereti? Assa nay kaqistanas adhi immistana gidees. <verse number="3-4" style="v"/>Hessappe guye qesista halaqatinne dere cimmati Qayafa getetiza qessista halaqa gibe gidon shiqidi hiillara Yesusa oythidi wodhisanas maqetida. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Gido atin asa garsan oshi dendontamala ba7ale galas gidoppo gidi qachida.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusa shito tiyida macashayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesusay Bitaniyan inchiracha hargera diza Simona getetizade son dishin <verse number="7" style="v"/>Issi macashi dizara wagay kezi al7o gidida albasxirose getetiza shito issi bilqaxe kumeth oykkada Yesusakko shiqada izi madan utidishin iza hu7e bolla shitoza gusadus. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Iza kalizayti hessa beydi haysi aazas mela moretize? <verse number="9" style="v"/>Shitozi daro wagas bayzetidi mishay manqotas imetizakoch? gida. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesusay hessa eridi hano macashayo aazas wayseti? iza tass lo7o othadus. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Manqoti wurso wode intenara detees, ta gidikko wurso wode intenara dikke gidees. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Iza shitoza ta bolla gusidaysi tana mogos gigidanasa. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ta intess tumu gays haysi wongelay sabaketiza alame yushon awnkka iza othidaysi izo qopisizaz gididi hasa7istana.</para>
  <para style="s">Yihuday Yesusa athi immanas gigetidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Hessappe guye tammane namm7atappe issay Asqorotu Yihuda getetizaysi qesista halaqatakko bidi <verse number="15" style="v"/>ta intees iza atha immikko inte tass ay immane? gidees. Istika izas hezu tammu birra iza kushen taybi immida. <verse number="16" style="v"/>He galasappe simidi Yihiday Yesusa istas athi immanas giga wode nagishe gam7idees.</para>
  <para style="s">Goda ka7o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Uketha ba7ale giza ba7ale galas iza kalizayti Yesusakko shiqidi ne paziga manaso awan gigisana mala koyay? gida. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Izikka istas zaridi gede katamma bidi ebelo getetiza ass asstamarey ta wodey matida gish tana kalizaytara paziga ta ne kethan bochana gidees gidi yotite gidees. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Iza kalizaytikka Yesusay ista azazida mala paziga kawo gigisida. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Gadey omarsishin Yesusay tammane nam7atara madan utidees. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Isti musan dishin izi istas ta tumu gays intefe issay athi immana gidees. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Istika kehi muzetidi taran taran Godo tanesha gida. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Izikka zaridi tana athi immanadey keren tanara kushe yedizadekko gidees. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Iza gish kasse xafetidaysa mala asa nay baana, gido attin asa na athi immizadees aye anna! he uray yeletonta atidakko izas lo7okoshin <verse number="25" style="v"/>Iza athi immana Yihuday “tamarsizayso tanesha?” gides. Izikka Ee ne gida mala, gidees. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Isti musan dishin Yesusay miza qummappe ekkidi anjidees. Menthidine bena kalizaytas immidi he7itte miitte, haysi ta ashokko gidees. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Qassekka usha denthidi galatidinne bena kalizaytas immidi “wurkka hayssappe uyitte.” <verse number="28" style="v"/>Daro asa nagarappe marana gukiza ta oratha caqo suthay hayssa. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ta intess gizay ta aawa kawotethan ta intenara oratha wogan uyana gakanas hayssappe sinthan hayssa woynne ayfe intenara uykke gidees. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Mazimure yexidappe guye pudde dabrazayte giza zumma bolla kezida.</para>
  <para style="s">Phixirosay iza kadanaysa Yesusay kasetidi yotidees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesusay istas inte wuri hach ommars tanan dhuphetidi tana yegi bana, hemizaysa ta shcana mehetinne lalistana getetidi kasse xafetidees gidees. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Gido atin tani dendaysafe guye intefe sinthatada gede Galila bana gidees. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Phixirosay zaridi hankoyti wuri ne gedon dhuphetikokka tani mulekka dhuphetikke gidees. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesusaykka izas zaridi “tumu gays hach qamma kuntoy uuonta kassistada hezu to ne tana kadana gidees. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Phixirosay qasse nenara ta hayqana koyshikokka mulekka ta nena kadikke gidees. Yesusa kaliza hankoytikka kumeth izaysathokka gida.</para>
  <para style="s">Getesemanen Yesusa wosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Hessappe guye Yesusay bena kalizaytara gede getesemane getetizaso bidees. Istakka he bada ta wosishin inte hayssan utishite gidees. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Phixirosarane Zabidossa nayta namm7ata benara ekki bishe ogge bolla muzetethine daro qoppo oykidees. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Hessapeka ta shempiya hayqana gakanas daro muzistadus tanara minidi hanini takitte gidees. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Istappe guth gede adhidi sintha bolla kundidi “ta aawaw ness danda7etikko haysi metoy tappe adho gido attin tani koydama mala gidonta neni koyda mala hano gi wosidees. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Hessappe simidi bena kalizaytakko yidi isti dhiskishin demidees. Phixirossakka hayto asato inte tanara issi satekkone minanas xonide? <verse number="41" style="v"/>Pacen inte gelonta mala minidi wositte, ayanani gigetidees shin ashoy gidikko daburancha gidees. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Qassekka nammanthao bidi ta aawaw hayssa uyanasi tass atonta miish gidikko ne sheney poleto gidi wosidees. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Qassekka izi yishin ista ayfe dhiskoy kumida gish zin7idayta beydees. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Ista agagidi qassekka bidi hezantho kasse wodida qaala zari wosidees. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Hessappe bena kalizaytakko simidi ha7ikka shempidi dhiskideti? heko ha7i satey matidees asa nay nagaranchata kushen adhi immistana gidees. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Dendite ane boss tana athi immizadey yussa bolla dees.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusay oyketidees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Izi hasa7ishin tamane namm7atappe issay Yihiday yidees. Qessista halaqatine dere cimati yedida daro asay torane duqa oykidi Yudara issi dees. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Yudaykka ta yerizadey iza gidida gish oykite gidi kasse yoti wothidees. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Siti gi Yesusakko bidi tamarsizayso saro gishe Yesusa yeridees. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Yesusaykka ta lagge ne yida qohaaththaa polla gidees. Herakka asay shiqetidi Yesusa oykidi qachidees. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Yesusara dizaytappe issay githa mash shodidi qesista halaqaza ashikara hayth qanxidees. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Yesusaykka anne ne mash kohon zara geltha masha shodizayti mashan dhayana. <verse number="53" style="v"/>koshikko ta ta aawa oychizakko daro shiyan qodetiza izi tass yedonta agana milatize? <verse number="54" style="v"/>Hessatho othikko qasse gesha maxafatan hanana getetidaysi wani polistane gidees. <verse number="55" style="v"/>He wode Yesusay asa wonbade oykiza asatho mashne durqa ekidi tana oykana yideti? Wontin wontin maqidasen utada ta tamarsishin kasse oykibeykista shin. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Gido atin haysi wurikka hanidaysi kasse nabeti gesha maxafatan yotidaysi polistanasa. Hessa wode Yesusa kalizayti iza yegidi dhayida.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusay pirda zulata sinth adhidees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>He wode Yesusa oykidi asati Muse woga astematetine dere cimati issippe shiqidason qesista halaqa Qayafakko ehaaththaida. <verse number="58" style="v"/>Gido atin Phixirosay qesista halaqa gibe gakanas hahora Yesusa kalidees. Gibe gido gelidi haizaysa wurseth beyanas gibe nagizaytara utidees. <verse number="59" style="v"/>He wode qesista halaqatine Ayhudata dulatay kumeth Yesusa wodhisanas wordo marka koydees. <verse number="60-61" style="v"/>Wordo markati daroti shiqikokka besiza markateth demibeytena, gido attin guyeppe namm7u ass dayti shiqidi haysi adezi ta Xoossa maqidasse lalada hezu galasara zarada kexana danda7ays gidees gidi markatida. <verse number="62" style="v"/>Hessa siyida qesista halaqay utethafe dendi eqidi hayti asati ne bolla markatizaysas aykoka zarikki gidees. <verse number="63" style="v"/>Yesusaykka co7u gidees, qesista halaqay ta nena de7o Xoossa sunthan oychays neni Kirstosa, Xoossa na gidikko tass yota gidees. <verse number="64" style="v"/>Yesusaykka ne goysokka mala gido attin intess wursos ta yotizay sinthappe asa nay wolqama ushichan utidi salo sharara yiza wode inte beyana gidees. <verse number="65" style="v"/>He wode qesista halaqay ba mayo dakidi Xoossa bolla xasha qaala hasa7idees, nus hayssafe adhiza hara azza markka koshze Xoossa bolla casha qaala izi hasa7ishin inte inte haythara siyidista. <verse number="66" style="v"/>Intes ay milatize? gidees. Istika zaridi izas hayqoy beses gida. <verse number="67" style="v"/>He wode Yesusa ayfeson cutishe icida, bagayti baqishe. <verse number="68" style="v"/>Kirstosa, ne nena nabe gasashin nena baqiday oonakkone ane nus yota gida.</para>
  <para style="s">Phixirosay Yesusa kadidees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v"/>Hessafe guye Phixirosay qessista halaqa gibe gido uti dishin issi ketha gidon othiza macash dizara izakko shiqada nenikka Galila Yesusara dizde gadus. <verse number="70" style="v"/>Izi qasse ne ay gizakone ta erikke gidi wurso asa sinthan kadidees. <verse number="71" style="v"/>Gibezappe keziza penge izi bishin issi hara othanchiya iza xelada hen gadan dizaytas haysi adezi Nazirete Yesusara dizadekko gadus. <verse number="72" style="v"/>Izikka ta iza erikke gidi namm7antho kadidees. <verse number="73" style="v"/>Guthu gamm7ishin hen eqida asati shiqidi Phixirossa ne hasa7ay ne haytara dizaysa qoncisees, tummappe ne ista baga asa gida. <verse number="74" style="v"/>Izikka caqishene ammatishe hessa adeza ta erikke gidees. Herakka kuutoy uu7ides. <verse number="75" style="v"/>Hessa wode Yesusay kasse Phixirosas kuutoy wasanas ne tana hezu to kaadana gidi yotida qalay qofetin Phixirosay kare kezidi cammo yeho yekidees.</para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yuday kaqeti hayqidees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Malado wontara qessista halaqatine dere cimati wurikka Yesusa wodhana ogge zoretida. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesusa qachi efidi gazhe Philaxossas athi immida. <verse number="3-4" style="v"/>Iza athi immida Yudaykka Yesusa bolla pirdetidaysa beydi atha immonta agarkina gidi ba ekida hezu tammu birra qessista halaqatisine dere cimatas zari immidi xillo asa atha immida gish ta moradis gidees. Istika histin nus ay meto ne era ekka gida. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hessa gish Yuday birra ehaaththaidi maqidasse gidon yegidi kezi bidi kaqeti hayqidees. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Qessista halaqati birra denthidi “sutha waga gidida gish maqidasse mishan gujanas bessena” gida. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Be garasan zoretidi imath gidida asatas dufo gidana mala issi mana (urqa miish medhizadeza) gade shamida. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Hesa gish he gadey hach gakanas sutha gade getetess. <verse number="9-10" style="v"/>Izas waga gidana mala Isra7ele nayti heregida hezu tammu birra qori ekida. Xoossi tana azazida mala urqa othancha gades immida getetidi nabe Ermasa dunan yotetidaysi poletidees.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusay Philaxossa sinthan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>He wode Yesusay dere harizaysa sinth shiqidees. Dere harizaysikka “Neni Ayhuda kawo?” gidi oychidees. Yesusaykka ne gida mala gido gidees. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Qessista halaqatine dere cimati iza kasasishin Yesusay istas ayne zaribeyna. <verse number="13" style="v"/>He wode Philaxosay Yesusa apun yon nena motizakone siyikki gidees. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Dere harizaysi kehi malalistana gakanas Yesusay issi qalaka zaribeyna. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Dere harizaysas ba7ale galas derey qasho asappe ebeloy nus birsheto gi oychikko issi ura birshiza wogay dees. <verse number="16" style="v"/>He wode gene othon erettida Yesusa getetiza Barbane getetiza issi qasho assi dees. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Derey shiqida mala Pilaxosay Barbaneppene Kirstosa getetiza Yesusappe ta intess oona birshana mala koyeti? gidees. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Philaxosay issti coo qanates athi immidaysa erishe oychidees. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Izi pirda zuppane bolla uti dishin iza machiya iza gedeon hach tani agumora darometotistadis, hessa xillo addeza bolla ne oothonta mala giza kitta Philaxosas yedadus. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Gido atin qessista halaqatinne cimati istas Barbaney birshistana malane qass Yesusa wodhana mala wossanas dereza qalay gagana mala othida. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Dere harizasi namm7atappe oona birshana mala koyeti? gi oychin issti Barbane birsha gida. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Philaxosaykka histakko Kirstosa getetiza Yesusa wosto gidees. Wurkka kaqeto gida. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Philaxosaykka aysi? ay iita othide? gidi sista oychidees. Issitkka qasse kehi wasidi qacheto gida. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Philaxossay hanizaysi wurikka asay ba garasan mulaketethafe atin hara ay go7ay bayndasa yushi xelidi “Haysa adeza sutha gommppe ta gesha, hayssafe guye inte shene gidi hathi ehisidi dereza sinthan ba kushe mecetidees. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Derey wuri iza suthi nu bollane nu nayta bolla gakko gidi zaridees. <verse number="26" style="v"/>He wodde Barbane isstas birshidi Yesusa garafisdappe guye kaqana mala athi immidees.</para>
  <para style="s">Wotadarati Yesusa bolla qilicida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Hessappe wotadarti Yesusa gede dere harizaysa gibe eeki bidi wuri shiqidi Yesusa gido athida. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Iza mayo qaridi hara ewidi zo7o mayo mayzida. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Aguntha akilile xaxidi gigisida, iza hu7e bolla gufanthida shambeqo gufe oshacha kushen oythidinne iza sinthan gulbatidi “Ayhuda kawo intees too” gidi iza qidhida. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Iza bolla cutida, shomboqo gufeza iza kusheppe ekkidi Yesusa hu7en zari zaridi shocida. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Iza bolla qidhi ka7idaysappe guye qassekka zo7o may7oza qari ekkidine kasse iza mayoza zari mayzidi kaqanaso ekki bida.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusay kaqetidees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Issti ekki bishin Qarna gizasoppe yida Simona getetizade demidi masqalezakka iza wolqara tosida. <verse number="33-34" style="v"/>Birshechaykka hu7e guge getetiza Golgotta getetizso gakishin ciyera walaketida woyne caje uya gidi immida, gido attin izi ganxi ekkidi uyana koybeyna. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Iza kaqidappe guyen iza mayoza bolla sama yegidi gishetida. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Hen utidi iza nagida. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Haysi Ayhuda kawo Yesusa giza moto qaala iza hu7eppe bollara wothida. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Nam7u wombadistappe issay Yesusappe oshacha bagara issay hadirsa bagra issi kaqetida. <verse number="39-40" style="v"/>Oggera adhi biza asay cayshene hu7e qathishe “maqidasse lalada hezu galasan othizayso, anne nena asha, ne Xoossa na gidikko anne masqale bollappe wodha” gida. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Qessista halaqati dere cimatara gididi iza bolla qidhishe hiz gida <verse number="42" style="v"/>Hara asa ashidees shin bena ashanas danda7ibeyna izi Isra7ele kawo gidikko ane ha7i masqale bollafe wodho, nukka iza ammanana. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Xoossan ammanetidees, bena Xoossa na gidamala Xoosi iza dosiza gidikko anne ha7i iza asho. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Izra issippe kaqetida wonbadetikka hessathokka casha qaala iza bolla qoqofida.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusa hayqo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Galasappe usuppun sateppe bidi uduppun sate gakanas kumetha bittay dhumidees. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Udufun sate gidishin Yesusay qaala dhoqu histidi “Elohe elohe lama sebeqitani gidi wasidees. Hessa gussas birshechay “ta Xoosso ta Xoosso tana aysi agadi” gussa. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Hen gadan eqida asatappe issi issi asati iza wasoza siyidi Elasa xeygeskko gida. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Isstappe issadey woxi bidi utha shedho woykko zanza milatizazi ekkidi calida woyne caje yegi caphisidine shomboqo getetiza miththa xeran qaphidi uyana mala Yesusa dunakko shishidees. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Hankko asay qasse agagitte ane Elasay yidi iza ashin beyana gida. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Yesusay qassekka dhoqa qalan wasidi shomppo kezidees. <verse number="51" style="v"/>He wode maqidasse magalashy bolla hu7era duge simmi daketidi nam7u kezidees bitaykka qaxidees zalatikka za7ida. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Dufotikka doyetida, kasse hayqida Xoossa asappe daro bagay dendidees. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Dufoppe kezidi Yesusa denthappe guye gede gesha katama gelidi darota ayfen betida. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Xetu wotadarata halaqayne izara issippe Yesusa nagizayti bitta qathanne hanidaysa wursi beydi daro babida. Qasse haysi tummappe Xoossa nakoshin gida. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Galilappe yidi Yesusa koshizazan othi madanas kaliza daro macashati hanizaysa wursikka hahora xelishe hen detees. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Issta gidon magideleppe yida Maramirane, Yaqobene Yossa ayo Maramira, qassekka Zabidossa nayta ayeyira issippe detees.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusay mogetidees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Gaddey ommarsishin Yosefo getetiza issi dure adde daysi Armatiyasa getetizasoppe yidees. Izikka ba bagara Yesusa kalizade. <verse number="58" style="v"/>Izi Philaxossa sinthi shiqidi Philaxossay Yesusa anha izas immana mala wosin Philaxosaykka izas immana mala azazidees. <verse number="59" style="v"/>Yosefoy anh7a ekkidi gesha mogo afalan xaxidees. <verse number="60" style="v"/>Shuchu wocidi bees gigisida dufon ehaaththai wothidi gita shuchu gendersidi dufoza gordidees. <verse number="61" style="v"/>Hessa wode Magidale Maramiranne hara Maramira dufoza ginan utida. <verse number="62" style="v"/>Sambatas gigetiza wontetha galas qessista halaqatine Pharsaweti Philaxossa sinth shiqidi hiz gida. <verse number="63" style="v"/>Godo he wordoy kasse paxa dishe hezu galasappe guye ta dendana gida qalay nu wozinan turchu gidees. <verse number="64" style="v"/>Hessa gish iza kalizayti iza anha kaysoti ekkidi deres izi hayqoppe dendidees gidi weresonta mala hezantho galas gakanas dufoy nagistana mala azaza, akkay gikko kaseysappe guye balay adheth gidana gida. <verse number="65" style="v"/>Philaxosaykka istas nagizayti detees bididnne intess erettida mala nagisitte gidees. <verse number="66" style="v"/>Isstikka bidi dufoza dunna mataman gordidi nagana zabe essida.</para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesusay hayqoppe dendidees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Sambatay adhidappe guye samintappe koyro galas buro saloy zo7ishin Magidale Marama hara Maramakka dufoza beyana bida. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Qopponta dishin gitta bitta qathi hanidees, Godda gitanchaykka salloppe wodhi dufakko bidi shucha gendesidi iza bolla utidees. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kitanchas medhay wolqantha po7o mala, mayoykka shacha mala bo7otu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Dufo nagizayti kitanchazas babidi kokoridinne hayqeth milatida. <verse number="5-6" style="v"/>Kitanachay macashata baboppite inte kaqetida Yesusa koyzasa ta erays izi ha7i han bawa, izi kasse yotida mala hayqoppe dendidees ha yidi izi zin7idaso beyte gidees. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ha7ikka eleli bidi iza kalizaytas hayqoppe dendidees intefe kasetidi Galila bees, inte iza hen demana gidi yotite hi7a ta intes yotidas. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Macashatikka babonine ufaysan kumidi iza kalizaytas yotanas elelidi wothan dufoy dizaso yegi agidi bida. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Herakka Yesusay ista demidi hayto saro gidees. Istika Yesusakko shiqidine iza to oykidi izas goynida. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesusay ista babofite bidine isti Galila banal mala ta ishatas yotite. Istti tana hen beyana gidees.</para>
  <para style="s">Nagizayta markateth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Macashati buro ogge bolla dishin nagizaytappe gutha bagati katama bidi hanidaysa wursi qesista halaqatas yotida. <verse number="12-13" style="v"/>Qessista halaqatikka dere cimatara shiqetidi zoretida, wotadaratas gidiza miish immidi nuni zin7on dishin iza kalizayti qammara yidi kaysi efida gite gida. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Haysi worey dere harizaysa matan siyetikokka nuni izas lo7othi yotana, aykko itaykka inte bolla gakkonta mala nu ootha gida. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Wotadaratikka misha ekkidi isti gida mala oothida, haysi yozi hach gakanas Ayhudata achan daro son yotetishe dees.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusay bena kalizata ayfen betidees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hessappekka Yesusa kaliza tamane issineti Yesusay issta besida Galilan diza zumma bolla kezida. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesusa be7idamala izas goynida, ista grasappe guxiza batati sidhida. <verse number="18-20" style="v"/>Yesusaykka bena kalizaytakko shiqidi salonine bitta bollan godatethi tass immetidees. Hessa gish bidi dere wursos Aawa Na7azane Xillo Ayana suthan xamaqishe tana kalizayta oothite, ta intena azazidaysa wursi nagana mala tamarsitte takka alame wurseth gakanas ta intenara daysi gidees.</para>
</usx>
